{"parentUuid":"eb8875e5-0752-45b1-aa31-8e5fa0ba57f2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdDPy7pciJCE56VwqMQFZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Correct call — I need to make the additive guarantee explicit and fix the one genuinely-destructive spot. Let me audit the plan against \"purely additive\": the only two places that mutate existing code rather than adding to it are (a) the constructor's `build_rope_cache(context_length,...)` and (b) the `T != context_length` guard at line 552. Both can be made strictly additive. Let me fix them and state the invariant up front."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":142472,"output_tokens":3041,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3041,"cache_read_input_tokens":142472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdDPy4RUZJqmXCg2uy57s","type":"assistant","uuid":"9dc15212-0338-4b90-9275-8d17bbf64690","timestamp":"2026-07-20T13:35:30.293Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.212","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"9dc15212-0338-4b90-9275-8d17bbf64690","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdDPy7pciJCE56VwqMQFZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D6qMgdorJPsrPYURGuFJNg","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/plans/polished-cuddling-graham.md","old_string":"## Files to change","new_string":"## Non-destructive / additive invariant (hard requirement)\n\nEvery change is **purely additive and gated behind `CP_CREAM_MODE`**. No existing line's default\nbehavior is altered or removed. With `CP_CREAM_MODE=off` (the default) the program must be\n**bit-for-bit identical to today** — same cache built the same way, same guard, same forward, same\neval. New behavior lives in new files, new members, new methods, and `if (cream_on) { ... } else\n{ <existing code verbatim> }` branches. This mirrors the established additive-gating discipline\nalready used in the CP stack (e.g. `-DCP_FUSED_ROPE` in `FusedRoPESDPA.h`, and the\n`use_rope_==false` default path in `ContextParallel.h:749`). Nothing existing is erased.\n\n## Files to change"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":142472,"output_tokens":3041,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3041,"cache_read_input_tokens":142472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdDPy4RUZJqmXCg2uy57s","type":"assistant","uuid":"ec60538a-9f13-4f1c-8b3c-d11bfed85510","timestamp":"2026-07-20T13:35:35.185Z","effort":"high","u