p_test.cpp nanoGPT loader). Read edufineweb .bin (headerless raw uint16, EOT=50256, 100M tok/shard, CP/Data_Loader/Data), packed 60000 contiguous 1024-tok blocks -> data/edufineweb_packed_1024.parquet. Added v1 \"pretrain_packed\" converter (pass-through input_ids) + Renderer.process_samples branch (feeds input_ids verbatim, labels=input_ids full-seq LM loss, position_ids 0..T-1, full causal attention across block = cross-doc). Set global_batch_size=64 (65536 tok/step, grad_accum16). Also root-caused earlier gpt2 wpe OOB: rendering.py position_ids=range(1,len+1) starts at 1 -> idx 1024 at ctx1024 (n_positions=2048 absorbs). Smoke 5-step PASS: gbs64/micro4/16 accum, cp=2 SP, real-data loss 10.917->10.699, CSV+TIMING ok, EXIT0 - LlamaFactory / src/llamafactory/v1/{plugins/data_plugins/converter.py,core/rendering/rendering.py}, gpt2_44m/pretrain_packed.yaml, examples/v1/train_full/gpt2_44m_pt_fsdp2_ulysses.yaml"," 2026-07-16 - Mem-scaling sweep folder for bluscriptCP (production CP model) vs DeepSpeed-Ulysses Qwen3: ported CP_MEM_PROBE snapshot mode into bluscriptCP.cpp (env CP_MEM_PROBE/CP_MEM_PROBE_STEPS/CP_MODEL_LABEL, grad_accum->1, skip val/ckpt, cudaMemGetInfo+alloc-peak+nvidia-smi snapshot matching gpt2_cp_test format) + new Tests/bluscriptcp/{mem_scaling_sweep.sh,mem_scaling_table.py} driving deepspeed qwen3_ds_ulysses.py; portable across 2xRTX3060/Nx6000Ada via CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES; syntax-verified (mpic++ c++20 fsyntax rc=0, bash -n, py_compile) NOT run end-to-end - CP / Scripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp, Tests/bluscriptcp/mem_scaling_sweep.sh, Tests/bluscriptcp/mem_scaling_table.py"," 2026-07-16 - bluscriptcp mem-scaling sweep: added CP_FFN + CP_WEIGHT_TYING env to bluscriptCP.cpp (ffn now recomputed 8/3*d_model after CP_N_EMBD override; tying env-settable) and expanded Tests/bluscriptcp/mem_scaling_sweep.sh to a 2-config matrix (48M d384/L6/6-2/ffn1024/untied + 114M d768/L12/12-4/ffn2048/tied) driving BOTH bluscriptCP and DS-Qwen3 with matching dims (DS head