 full `T×T` forward. At 16k on one GPU that's the expensive part, so use the *smallest* window count that gives a stable curve; validate the shape at small T first.\\n\\nKeep `CP_EVAL_WINDOWS` **identical across models A/B/C** — the comparison is only valid if every curve is averaged over the same number of samples on the same eval data.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":48},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e601931c-ad6f-452b-beec-712ad439ddc4","timestamp":"2026-07-21T04:43:15.767Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.215","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
