{"parentUuid":"6f8e327b-2bca-4889-adc7-635a047208b3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdEdsCQfBJ6rL69JKdoH9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No. `CP_CREAM_SIGMA` does **not** touch `T` or the extension length at all.\n\n- **What sets 16k:** `YARN_SCALE × CP_T`. That's it. `scaled_max = factor·CP_T` — the position range the labels can span. (e.g. `CP_T=4096`, `YARN_SCALE=4` → labels reach 16k.)\n- **What σ does:** given that range is already fixed at [0, 16k), σ only controls *where inside it* the middle block tends to land — tightly clustered at the center (small σ) vs. spread toward the extremes (large σ). It reshapes the *sampling distribution*, not the range.\n\nAnalogy: `YARN_SCALE` sets how wide the dartboard is (up to 16k); σ sets how tightly your throws cluster around the bullseye (the middle). Changing σ never makes the board bigger.\n\nSo the physical sequence stays `CP_T` (4k of real attention), the reachable positions stay `factor·CP_T` (16k), regardless of σ. σ just tunes how much of the training emphasizes middle positions."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3405,"cache_read_input_tokens":288971,"output_tokens":516,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3405,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":516,"cache_read_input_tokens":288971,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3405},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdEds5J2gfXzomqPbyu9z","type":"assistant","uuid":"459507f8-68dd-4a3f-89c2-fad350f9dd1e","timestamp":"2026-07-21T05:17:49.284Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/