{"parentUuid":"34d3d353-731c-4ee1-896f-4e67bba7ff53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdFHX4wpA38rqSemQdchC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_read_input_tokens":307960,"output_tokens":2408,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2408,"cache_read_input_tokens":307960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdFHWzRhwEsL1To9FRd3h","type":"assistant","uuid":"244a8b73-1ba9-41db-9a31-09febce17dd8","timestamp":"2026-07-21T13:31:47.412Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.215","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"244a8b73-1ba9-41db-9a31-09febce17dd8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdFHX4wpA38rqSemQdchC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That failure is just the multi-line paste breaking — the trailing `\\` continuations got mangled, so `NP=1` and `CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_B_yarn.csv` ran together into `NP=1_yarn.csv`, and a stray `\\` got handed to `env`. The commands are fine; **run each as a single line** (no backslashes).\n\nFirst set the var on one line (replace `<BASE>` with the base run number that printed during training):\n```bash\nEVAL=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_CREAM_MODE=off CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0 CP_T=16384 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=4 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads\"\n```\n\nThen three single-line runs:\n```bash\nenv $EVAL CP_CKPT_RESUME=<BASE> CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_C_naive.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1\n```\n```bash\nenv $EVAL CP_CKPT_RESUME=101 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_A_cream.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1\n```\n```bash\nenv $EVAL CP_CKPT_RESUME=102 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_B_yarn.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1\n```\n\nTwo things to check:\n- `NP=1` must be the **last token** and on the same line — it's a *make* variable, not a shell one, so it can't be inside `$EVAL`.\n- If your shell keeps choking on long pastes, drop it in a script instead:\n```bash\nprintf '%s\\n' '#!/bin/bash' \\\n  'env '\"$EVAL\"' CP_CKPT_RESUME='\"$1\"' CP_EVAL_OUT='\"$2\"' make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1' > run_eval.sh\nchmod +x run_eval.sh\n./run_eval.sh <BASE> ppl_C_naive.csv\n./run_eval.sh 101 ppl_A_cream.csv\n./run_eval.sh 102 ppl_B_yarn.csv\n```\n\nThat's the same pattern your training smoke runs used successfully — the only thing that broke was the pasted line-continuations."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_read_input_tokens":307960,"output_tokens":2408,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2408,"cache_read_input_tokens":307960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1187,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1187},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdFHWzRhwEsL1To9FRd3h","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ae36cd7-ed88-40df-94fa-82225ee5be5f","timestamp":"2026-07-21T13:31:56.854Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.215","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
