{"parentUuid":"56f60183-b741-45e7-bf58-1ae3f7b282b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdFKDjY212FHoCSE8udyC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Only three things need to change: the `CURVES` filenames (to match your three CSVs), and cosmetics (48M, title). The smoothing, log-axis, and verdict-table logic already work for any number of curves. Here's the drop-in:\n\nReplace the `CURVES` block (lines 30–34) with:\n```python\nCURVES = {\n    'C: base @16384 (naive, YaRN inference-only)': 'ppl_C_naive.csv',\n    'A: CREAM+YaRN @16384':                        'ppl_A_cream.csv',\n    'B: YaRN LCE @16384':                          'ppl_B_yarn.csv',\n}\n```\n\n`ORIG_CTX = 4096` is already right for your 4k→16k setup — keep it.\n\nAnd the title (line 52), just cosmetic:\n```python\nplt.title('Long-context PPL-vs-position (48M): CREAM vs YaRN-LCE vs naive')\n```\n\nThat's all — everything else works unchanged.\n\n## How to read the output\n- **Curve shape:** past the dashed `4096` line, **C** should blow up; **A (CREAM)** and **B (YaRN-LCE)** should stay flat/low and overlap. A≈B flat = CREAM matched full 16k fine-tuning cheaply.\n- **Verdict table** (`ratio = PPL≥ORIG / PPL<ORIG`): ~1.0 = flat = worked; ≫1 = extension failed. You want A's and B's ratios both near 1 and much smaller than C's.\n\nTwo notes:\n- The default `smooth(k=64)` window is fine at 16k; if a curve looks too washed out or too jagged, tweak `k`.\n- The cell reads CSVs **next to the notebook** — since you're running the notebook on the same box, just make sure the three `ppl_*.csv` are in the notebook's working directory (or give absolute paths in `CURVES`).\n\nWant me to write this corrected cell directly into `graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb` (or save it as the eval cell in that notebook) so you don't have to hand-edit?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4358,"cache_read_input_tokens":309147,"output_tokens":1083,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4358,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1083,"cache_read_input_tokens":309147,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4358,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4358},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdFKDhXxmev9aWCGTz3qE","type":"assistant","uuid":"29ee1c4e-5143-4f6c-9883-5e45309c98c5","timestamp":"2026-07-21T13:54:06.009Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.215","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
