{"parentUuid":"ab4d6c3f-73f3-44d3-81a8-997fd5c19823","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_19654","hookName":"Stop","hookEvent":"Stop","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"[ContinuousLearning] Session has 143 messages - evaluate for extractable patterns\n[ContinuousLearning] Save learned skills to: /home/blu-bridge25/.claude/skills/learned/\n","exitCode":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"79651d9c-8a24-4a5d-b403-a5b81c2103cd","timestamp":"2026-07-22T07:02:08.784Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"79651d9c-8a24-4a5d-b403-a5b81c2103cd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdGfeKbdrwWzx2dbPyDeq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3982,"cache_read_input_tokens":348177,"output_tokens":1197,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3982,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1197,"cache_read_input_tokens":348177,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3982},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdGfeE9DqYTDhPYKzk3Bc","type":"assistant","uuid":"ed7074ea-675b-457b-80b1-28cb4cb590b4","timestamp":"2026-07-22T07:02:25.586Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"ed7074ea-675b-457b-80b1-28cb4cb590b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdGfeKbdrwWzx2dbPyDeq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — `CP_B` is free to change; CREAM doesn't care about batch size. The per-step relabel/gather is applied to the shared cache regardless of `B` (one labeling per step covers all `B` rows), and no fused-kernel constraint touches `B` (those are on `T` and `head_dim`, not batch).\n\nThe one thing to keep fixed is **`CP_GLOBAL_BATCH`**, so the optimization stays comparable:\n\n- `grad_accum = CP_GLOBAL_BATCH / (CP_B · CP_T · dp)` is derived. Dropping `B` from 4→2 just **doubles grad_accum** — same tokens/step, same trajectory, half the memory per microstep, slightly more microsteps (a bit slower).\n- With `B=2, T=4096, dp=1`: `131072 / (2·4096) = 16` — integer, so it's valid. (Keep `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH` divisible by `CP_B·CP_T·dp` or it'll error.)\n\nSo for the sweep, either:\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_T=4096 CP_B=2 CP_CREAM_MODE=cream ... YARN_SCALE=$F ...\n```\nis perfectly fine — just use the **same `CP_B` (or at least the same `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH`) across all F** so the only variable is the extension factor. Lowering to `B=2` is a good move if you're memory-tight; it costs a little throughput, nothing else."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3982,"cache_read_input_tokens":348177,"output_tokens":1197,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3982,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1197,"cache_read_input_tokens":348177,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3982},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdGfeE9DqYTDhPYKzk3Bc","type":"assistant","uuid":"55c751a2-c84e-4d61-a0cd-74e4851396d6","timestamp":"2026-07-22T07:02:31.031Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"55c751a2-c84e-4d61-a0cd-74e4851396d6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"Stop","toolUseID":"90a92566-fe4f-4ae0-a8f5-c3305a4c85b1","hookEvent":"Stop","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"7f89f0ac-da79-42e5-975f-b63bab3c65d2\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/7f89f0ac-da79-42e5-975f-b63bab3c65d2.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"606f676f-5d45-4ad5-96fb-0462363a6bab\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"Stop\",\"stop_hook_active\":false,\"last_assistant_message\":\"Yes — `CP_B` is free to change; CREAM doesn't care about batch size. The per-step relabel/gather is applied to the shared cache regardless of `B` (one labeling per step covers all `B` rows), and no fused-kernel constraint touches `B` (those are on `T` and `head_dim`, not batch).\\n\\nThe one thing to keep fixed is **`CP_GLOBAL_BATCH`**, so the optimization stays comparable:\\n\\n- `grad_accum = CP_GLOBAL_BATCH / (CP_B · CP_T · dp)` is derived. Dropping `B` from 4→2 just **doubles grad_accum** — same tokens/step, same trajectory, half the memory per microstep, slightly more microsteps (a bit slower).\\n- With `B=2, T=4096, dp=1`: `131072 / (2·4096) = 16` — integer, so it's valid. (Keep `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH` divisible by `CP_B·CP_T·dp` or it'll error.)\\n\\nSo for the sweep, either:\\n```bash\\nenv $ARCH CP_T=4096 CP_B=2 CP_CREAM_MODE=cream ... YARN_SCALE=$F ...\\n```\\nis perfectly fine — just use the **same `CP_B` (or at least the same `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH`) across all F** so the only variable is the extension factor. Lowering to `B=2` is a good move if you're memory-tight; it costs a little throughput, nothing else.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":45},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3306aa83-3249-4a89-a951-5ffe9d4365bc","timestamp":"2026-07-22T07:02:31.105Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
