 to 1222 (not \\\"complete as it starts\\\"). After that your sweep is:\\n\\n| run | F | YARN_SCALE (train + eval) | target len |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| 31 | 2 | 2 | 8k |\\n| 32 | 4 | 4 | 16k |\\n| 33 | 8 | 8 | 32k |\\n| 34 | 16 | 16 | 64k |\\n\\nThen eval each with its matching `YARN_SCALE` and `CP_T = 4096·F`, `CP_CREAM_MODE=off`, `CP_B=1`. Reminder: the 32k/64k evals are the ones most likely to hit the single-GPU logits-memory ceiling — if run33/34 OOM at eval, that's the test-rig limit, not the model.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":41},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e07db837-2c5b-4317-9eef-068fb861fd61","timestamp":"2026-07-22T15:17:34.854Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
