{"parentUuid":"2757f5a7-c041-439f-b369-5fe240162ff2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_63274","hookName":"Stop","hookEvent":"Stop","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"[ContinuousLearning] Session has 147 messages - evaluate for extractable patterns\n[ContinuousLearning] Save learned skills to: /home/blu-bridge25/.claude/skills/learned/\n","exitCode":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"07c6530f-bc5a-4119-b9f1-2bce7cd580d2","timestamp":"2026-07-22T19:15:22.540Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"07c6530f-bc5a-4119-b9f1-2bce7cd580d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdHdZEtVcgtTrWXQizDJL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2280,"cache_read_input_tokens":360510,"output_tokens":1351,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2280,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":360510,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2280},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHdZBrgjXtNrVpSwV6eu","type":"assistant","uuid":"635bb964-a01e-4273-8012-026cff40e684","timestamp":"2026-07-22T19:15:37.213Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"635bb964-a01e-4273-8012-026cff40e684","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdHdZEtVcgtTrWXQizDJL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Use **`CP_B=1` for eval** — and no, it does *not* need to match training's B. They're independent.\n\n**Why B doesn't need to match:** batch size isn't a model parameter. In a decoder there's no cross-sequence interaction, so each sequence's per-position NLL is identical whether you run it alone or in a batch of 8. At eval, `CP_B` only affects:\n- **memory** (`[B, T, V]` logits scale linearly with B), and\n- **sample count** per position: `count[t] = CP_EVAL_WINDOWS × CP_B`.\n\nThe PPL *values* are unchanged by B.\n\n**Why B=1 specifically for eval:** memory. At long targets the logits tensor dominates — at 16k/32k/64k, `B=8` is 8× that memory and will OOM. `B=1` keeps the long-T evals feasible. Since the far arms (x8, x16) essentially force `B=1` anyway, use `B=1` for **all** arms so they're uniform.\n\n**What to keep constant instead:** total sequences per position = `CP_EVAL_WINDOWS × CP_B`. With `B=1` everywhere, just keep `CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32` (or whatever) the same across arms and you're comparable. If you ever mix B values, compensate with windows so `windows × B` matches — but simplest is `B=1` + fixed windows for the whole sweep.\n\nSo: training `B` (8 or 2) is an optimization/memory choice; eval `B=1` is purely to fit the long forward in memory. They don't have to agree, and for this sweep they shouldn't — eval stays at `B=1`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2280,"cache_read_input_tokens":360510,"output_tokens":1351,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2280,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":360510,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2280,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2280},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHdZBrgjXtNrVpSwV6eu","type":"assistant","uuid":"d81928db-6489-4e72-acaf-057d324d696c","timestamp":"2026-07-22T19:15:44.047Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
