{"parentUuid":"25670308-d0f0-4586-903f-d4487722a4e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdHeCJd1WxM3HuwfZK7Ty","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That error means your `ARCH` variable got mangled on paste — a space slipped into `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH`, splitting it into `CP_GLOBAL_B` + `ATCH=131072`. `env` then tried to run `CP_GLOBAL_B` as a command → \"No such file or directory.\"\n\nTwo things:\n\n**1. Eval doesn't use `CP_GLOBAL_BATCH` at all** (it's forward-only, no optimizer), so just drop it. Re-declare a clean eval-only ARCH on one line:\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0 CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads\"\n```\nThen **verify it's intact** before using it:\n```bash\necho \"$ARCH\"\n```\nYou should see `...CP_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0 CP_DATA_ROOT=...` with `CP_FFN` in one piece and no stray spaces inside any name.\n\n**2. Also confirm `RUN` and `BASE` survived** (this looks like a fresh shell on a different mount, `/mnt/volgrp03/...`):\n```bash\ndeclare -p RUN 2>/dev/null; echo \"BASE=$BASE\"\n```\nIf `RUN` is empty, re-set it:\n```bash\ndeclare -A RUN=( [2]=31 [4]=32 [8]=33 [16]=34 )\n```\n\n**Also check `CP_DATA_ROOT`** — this box's path is `/mnt/volgrp03/...`, so `$HOME/Downloads` may not be where the data is. Point it at whatever you used for the *training* runs on this machine.\n\nThen re-run the eval loop unchanged:\n```bash\nfor F in 2 4 8 16; do R=${RUN[$F]}; T=$((4096*F)); env $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_CREAM_MODE=off CP_T=$T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=$F YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$R CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_cream_x${F}.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1; done\n```\n\nIf it still complains, paste the output of `echo \"$ARCH\"` and I'll spot the break."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1701,"cache_read_input_tokens":362790,"output_tokens":2672,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1701,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2672,"cache_read_input_tokens":362790,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1701,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1701},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdHeCED6amjCg9cg7864d","type":"assistant","uuid":"2217eb9c-880f-40ac-87d2-68c47a4d7a2a","timestamp":"2026-07-22T19:24:22.336Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
