 \\\"extrapolation done as gently as possible\\\" — so if it *still* underperforms the CREAM arm, that gap is what training-on-long-positions bought (modulo the step-count caveat).\\n\\nIn one line: **the eval teacher-forces real long sequences through the loaded weights and records per-position next-token perplexity; \\\"naive\\\" just means those weights are the un-fine-tuned base, tested the exact same way as the CREAM arms.**\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":47},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ae2a1c12-6a9e-4711-898f-031171b42aec","timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:13:36.032Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
