{"parentUuid":"898cb944-c7a4-489e-ae99-cdd91781f259","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_93937","hookName":"Stop","hookEvent":"Stop","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"[ContinuousLearning] Session has 155 messages - evaluate for extractable patterns\n[ContinuousLearning] Save learned skills to: /home/blu-bridge25/.claude/skills/learned/\n","exitCode":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a8a2d7db-33e9-4aec-bf8a-8d13ec85136c","timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:19:11.980Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"a8a2d7db-33e9-4aec-bf8a-8d13ec85136c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdJRbsJfHiyKRwp37Kmob","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3114,"cache_read_input_tokens":381077,"output_tokens":1667,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1667,"cache_read_input_tokens":381077,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3114},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJRbpUziGUC8uSDmHQ96","type":"assistant","uuid":"11b19218-16c8-47bb-a991-3354e5e19e58","timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:19:25.886Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"11b19218-16c8-47bb-a991-3354e5e19e58","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdJRbsJfHiyKRwp37Kmob","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Right — you need the **x16 (64k)** arm for *both* the CREAM curve (run 34) and the naive baseline. Run these two single-liners (`$ARCH` and `BASE` set as before):\n\n**CREAM x16 (run 34, 64k):**\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_CREAM_MODE=off CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=16 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 CP_CKPT_RESUME=34 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_cream_x16.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1\n```\n\n**Naive x16 (base at 64k):**\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_CREAM_MODE=off CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=16 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$BASE CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_naive_x16.csv make CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 run-bluscript-cp NP=1\n```\n\nThen add both to the notebook `CURVES`:\n```python\n    'x16 CREAM (64k)': 'ppl_cream_x16.csv',\n    'x16 naive (64k)': 'ppl_naive_x16.csv',\n```\n\nTwo heads-up for 64k specifically:\n- **Memory:** the logits tensor is `[1, 65536, 50304]` ≈ **13 GB fp32**. On this server GPU (you pinned device 3) it likely fits if it's a big card; on a 12 GB card it'll OOM. If it OOMs, that's the single-GPU eval ceiling, not the model — you'd need chunked-logits or CP eval.\n- **Data length:** the far positions (up to 64k) only carry real signal if your val documents are ≥64k tokens. If they're shorter, positions past the doc length aren't meaningful — check that your val shards actually contain 64k-token windows, or the tail of the x16 curve is measuring padding/repeats, not true long-range prediction.\n\nThat completes the sweep: CREAM {x2,x4,x8,x16} + naive {x2,x4,x8,x16}, all evaluable and overlay-able."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3114,"cache_read_input_tokens":381077,"output_tokens":1667,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1667,"cache_read_input_tokens":381077,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3114},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdJRbpUziGUC8uSDmHQ96","type":"assistant","uuid":"f5111122-0561-4d89-a265-01d4d8d4f22f","timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:19:35.296Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
