al shards actually contain 64k-token windows, or the tail of the x16 curve is measuring padding/repeats, not true long-range prediction.\\n\\nThat completes the sweep: CREAM {x2,x4,x8,x16} + naive {x2,x4,x8,x16}, all evaluable and overlay-able.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":46},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5eb0cbc1-a771-4fdf-8ca5-629e7ac71946","timestamp":"2026-07-23T05:19:35.466Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.216","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
