{"parentUuid":"754cedca-84e5-480c-8fb4-854a11f45ade","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"todo_reminder","content":[{"content":"Create context_parallel/CreamPositions.h (3-layer: math, range/CDF, sampling wrapper) + PoSE/RandPos","status":"completed","activeForm":"Creating CreamPositions.h"},{"content":"Write Tests/cream_positions_test.cpp (golden math, range/CDF, structural, randint, PoSE/RandPos) and run RED->GREEN","status":"completed","activeForm":"Writing cream_positions_test.cpp"},{"content":"Add set_rope_cache setter to context_parallel/ContextParallel.h (additive, grad-free assert)","status":"completed","activeForm":"Adding set_rope_cache setter"},{"content":"Integrate into Scripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp (config/env, asserts, cream_full_cache_, gated guard, per-step install, eval path)","status":"completed","activeForm":"Integrating CREAM into bluscriptCP.cpp"},{"content":"Write Tests/cream_cache_gather_parity.cpp (gather==direct RoPE + YaRN spot-check), wire Makefile","status":"completed","activeForm":"Writing cream_cache_gather_parity.cpp"},{"content":"Document CP_CREAM_* env vars in README.md","status":"completed","activeForm":"Documenting in README.md"},{"content":"Build bluscript-cp with CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 (compile-verify integration)","status":"completed","activeForm":"Building bluscript-cp"},{"content":"Verification: parity test, off-mode regression, CREAM smoke run, distribution check","status":"completed","activeForm":"Running verification"},{"content":"Log work to Obsidian Logs.md + write session report","status":"completed","activeForm":"Logging work"}],"itemCount":9},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1d64156b-40db-47b3-a333-915a1c7513dd","timestamp":"2026-07-31T10:19:33.508Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
