{"parentUuid":"81ddf8d0-469c-4882-a0e7-4331d719d23a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cda3xnhvZJQwmserBiaqH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MTZnSaNhfmXS9rfWoWSftG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> \"/home/blu-bridge25/Documents/obsidian Vaults/Adhitya's Vault/Claude Logs.md\" << 'EOF'\n2026-07-31 - Implemented LongRoPE (searched non-uniform RoPE, arXiv:2402.13753) in bluscriptCP, fully ADDITIVE (CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS unset => byte-identical). (0) NEW build_rope_cache_longrope in YARNOps.cpp + context_parallel/LongRoPEOps.h: angle(n,i)=n*base_freq_i/(n<n_hat?1:lambda_i), NeoX half-split matching YaRN builder, NO m temperature, monotone/>=1/size guards; Tests/cp_rope_longrope_parity.cpp (CPU value checks: lambda=1/n_hat=0==plain RoPE, lambda=s==pos*base_freq/s, n_hat threshold straddle, guards throw) ALL PASS maxdiff~1e-7 via make cp-rope-longrope. (1) bluscriptCP.cpp gating: parse_longrope_factors (n_hat/s/S_search/lambda file), longrope-alone static install (build at CP_T, set_rope_cache all layers), composed-with-CREAM builds cream_full_cache_ via longrope builder + CRITICAL coupling asserts (S_search==cream_scaled_max, s==cream_factor) reusing CREAM's hardened factor=YARN_SCALE/scaled_max invariant. (2) Resident evaluator CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH=1: loads model once, reads candidate factor-file paths on stdin, rebuilds only the cheap CPU cache per candidate, prints overall PPL (avoids ~2560 model reloads/search). (2) Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py GA driver: grid [1,s*1.25] step 0.01, n_hat set, P=64/N1=16/N2=16/40 iters/top32/pmut=0.3, seeds PI(lambda=s)/NTK(s^(2i/(d-2)))/YaRN(1/((ramp/s)+(1-ramp)) ported from YARNOps find_correction_range), mutation=per-dim RESAMPLE at 0.3, crossover, repair_monotone=running-max (NEVER sort), memoize on grid indices. README CP_LONGROPE_* section + factors-file format. Build clean (CP_FUSED_ROPE=1, exit 0 both bluscript-cp + parity). GPU runtime verification (off-mode training, swap-takes-effect 3b, coupling-assert-with-model, search smoke) PENDING - both 3060s saturated (11.6/12GB) by user's running jobs; CPU parity green. Plan: /home/blu-bridge25/.claude/plans/polished-cuddling-graham.md (2 review rounds). Explanation: .mdfiles/LongRoPEexplanasion.md - CP / context_parallel/{LongRoPEOps.h,YARNOps.cpp}, Scripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp, Tests/cp_rope_longrope_parity.cpp, Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py, Makefile, README.md\nEOF\necho \"logged\"","description":"Append LongRoPE log entry"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1303,"cache_read_input_tokens":583351,"output_tokens":1215,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1303,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1215,"cache_read_input_tokens":583351,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1303},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cda3xhqELrZjDcn9QxjxL","type":"assistant","uuid":"1ddd7e3f-98ea-45c4-bdaa-12c7744748af","timestamp":"2026-07-31T11:25:16.458Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
