{"parentUuid":"a7b0d09c-ce02-45ee-83dc-f0edc929defb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdaAvAGhA7wccPxgDwx6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568573,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":3057,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568573,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3057,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568573},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdaAv45d6CYm2x8CGwULb","type":"assistant","uuid":"e1756480-a71d-4f19-afc9-5c99277d8454","timestamp":"2026-07-31T12:56:32.724Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"e1756480-a71d-4f19-afc9-5c99277d8454","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdaAvAGhA7wccPxgDwx6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I understood 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8\n\nHere's the end-to-end runbook. One thing first: **the search and any apply/eval need a free GPU** — both 3060s are currently full, so run these when one frees (pin it with `--cuda-devices`/`CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`).\n\n## 0. Build (once) + CPU parity (no GPU needed)\n```bash\nmake CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 bluscript-cp cp-rope-longrope\nLD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n  ./build/cp_rope_longrope_parity_exec        # already passes\n```\n\n## 1. You need a checkpoint to search against\nReuse an existing run, or train a tiny one:\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_T=4096 CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=131072 CP_MAX_STEPS=1000 CP_WARMUP=100 \\\n    CP_CKPT=1 CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec        # note the run number it prints\n```\n\n## 2. Run the LongRoPE search\n`--target-t` is the length you're extending to. For the **CREAM-composed** path it **must** equal `factor·(physical T)` (e.g. `4·4096 = 16384`), and `--s` = that factor. Start tiny to smoke it, then scale:\n```bash\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\n  --exec ./build/bluscriptCP_exec --ckpt-run <run> \\\n  --target-t 16384 --s 4 --head-dim 64 --orig-maxpos 4096 \\\n  --data-root $HOME/Downloads --cuda-devices 0 \\\n  --arch \"$ARCH\" \\\n  --pop 6 --iters 3 --calib-windows 2 \\\n  --out longrope_best.txt\n```\nIt prints per-generation best PPL and writes `longrope_best.txt`. For a real search use `--pop 64 --iters 40 --calib-windows 5` (slow — one resident model load, then many cache swaps).\n\n## 3. Apply the searched factors\n**Option A — LongRoPE alone** (extends directly; fine-tune is full-length, memory-heavy):\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_T=16384 CP_B=1 CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=<run> CP_MAX_STEPS=<+K> CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=... mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n**Option B — composed with CREAM** (recommended on the 3060: 4k-physical fine-tune, LongRoPE cache as gather source):\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_T=4096 CP_B=2 CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\n    YARN_SCALE=4 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=<run> CP_MAX_STEPS=<+K> CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=... mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n(Here the startup coupling assert checks `S_search==16384==4·4096` and `s==4`; a mismatch dies with a clear message.)\n\n## 4. Eval the LongRoPE arm (PPL vs position)\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=16384 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=<extended_run> \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_longrope_x4.csv CP_DATA_ROOT=$HOME/Downloads CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=... mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\nOverlay `ppl_longrope_x4.csv` with your CREAM/YaRN curves in `graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb`.\n\nTwo reminders: the `--s`/`--target-t` you search with must match how you apply it, and every command needs `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES` pointed at a free GPU. Want me to bundle steps 2–4 into a single `run_longrope.sh` with the run number and factor as arguments?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568573,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":3057,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568573,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3057,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":568573,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":568573},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdaAv45d6CYm2x8CGwULb","type":"assistant","uuid":"5bc1fc0c-76a6-416d-b9eb-10b67751fbf2","timestamp":"2026-07-31T12:56:51.811Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
