{"parentUuid":"5f82ab48-140e-4b4c-b938-9e06c0424495","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdaPseR3C5DAWQxuAna3M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both pass (`bash -n` and Python parse). The script is ready and executable at [Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh](Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh).\n\n## Launch it now (it waits for the base, then runs everything)\n```bash\nnohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n```\n\nIt does, in order:\n1. **Waits** — polls for the base checkpoint at `step ≥ 1000`, then waits until GPU 0 has ≥4 GB free (so it starts only after the base releases the GPU).\n2. **Search** — runs `longrope_search.py` (target 16k, s=4) → `longrope_best.txt`.\n3. **Fine-tune** — branches the base into run `200` and fine-tunes **CREAM-composed at 4k physical** (LongRoPE cache as gather source — cheap, fits the 3060; the coupling assert `S_search=16384=4·4096` holds automatically).\n4. **Eval** — PPL-vs-position at 16k → `ppl_longrope_x4.csv` to overlay in the notebook.\n\n## Check/edit these at the top before launching\n- **`ARCH`** — I defaulted to your 48M (`d384/L6/6-2/ffn1024/untied`). **Confirm this matches the base you're training**, or the resume won't load.\n- **`BASE_MAX_STEPS=1000`** — must equal your base's `CP_MAX_STEPS` (you're at 889/1000, so 1000 looks right).\n- **`GPU=0`** — set to whichever GPU is free after the base finishes (or override: `GPU=1 nohup bash ... &`).\n- **Search size** — defaults to a **modest** `POP=16 ITERS=8 CALIB=3` (~a few hundred evals) so it finishes in reasonable time. The paper is `POP=64 ITERS=40 CALIB=5` (thousands of evals, **hours**). Override when you want the real thing: `POP=64 ITERS=40 CALIB=5 nohup bash ... &`.\n\n## What it produces\n- `longrope_best.txt` — the searched `λ`/`n̂`.\n- run `200` — the LongRoPE+CREAM fine-tuned checkpoint.\n- `ppl_longrope_x4.csv` — the arm to overlay against your CREAM/YaRN/naive curves.\n\nEverything runs on the resident evaluator (model loaded once per search), all gated so it composes cleanly with the CREAM path you already validated. Note: the whole chain still needs one GPU free once the base is done — the script blocks until it is, so you can launch it now and walk away."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":262,"cache_read_input_tokens":620101,"output_tokens":1968,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":262,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1968,"cache_read_input_tokens":620101,"cache_creation_input_tokens":262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":262},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdaPsZLSou7FigPmYgcmF","type":"assistant","uuid":"733b82ef-8f24-4503-8565-7d1fbc72e24b","timestamp":"2026-07-31T15:46:33.663Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
