U=1 nohup bash ... &`).\\n- **Search size** — defaults to a **modest** `POP=16 ITERS=8 CALIB=3` (~a few hundred evals) so it finishes in reasonable time. The paper is `POP=64 ITERS=40 CALIB=5` (thousands of evals, **hours**). Override when you want the real thing: `POP=64 ITERS=40 CALIB=5 nohup bash ... &`.\\n\\n## What it produces\\n- `longrope_best.txt` — the searched `λ`/`n̂`.\\n- run `200` — the LongRoPE+CREAM fine-tuned checkpoint.\\n- `ppl_longrope_x4.csv` — the arm to overlay against your CREAM/YaRN/naive curves.\\n\\nEverything runs on the resident evaluator (model loaded once per search), all gated so it composes cleanly with the CREAM path you already validated. Note: the whole chain still needs one GPU free once the base is done — the script blocks until it is, so you can launch it now and walk away.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":52},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9e720d94-5668-40ba-a89b-e772693fbaa9","timestamp":"2026-07-31T15:46:33.763Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
