{"parentUuid":"d98ceff0-4d53-4503-902f-e0dd4b1e80f0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdaQMc8AAEkGWFm7cE7wZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":631255,"output_tokens":1771,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":348,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1771,"cache_read_input_tokens":631255,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":348},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdaQMYQRF2awYuFvsu9QH","type":"assistant","uuid":"ba02b674-b5fe-4b6a-b77f-09d77470b672","timestamp":"2026-07-31T15:52:37.893Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"ba02b674-b5fe-4b6a-b77f-09d77470b672","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdaQMc8AAEkGWFm7cE7wZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`py OK`, and both GPUs now have ~3.5 GB free (base is using ~8 GB each) — after it finishes, ~11.7 GB frees, well above the script's 4 GB gate.\n\n## The command (fits 12h automatically)\n```bash\nnohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n```\n\nThe pipeline is now **wall-clock–bounded**, so it can't overrun no matter how slow each eval is:\n\n| Stage | Budget | How it's bounded |\n|---|---|---|\n| Search (LongRoPE GA) | **8.5 h** | `SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=30600` — runs full `POP=64/ITERS=40` but stops at 8.5h and writes best-so-far |\n| Fine-tune (CREAM-composed, 4k) | ~50 min | 300 steps × ~10 s |\n| Eval (PPL @16k, 32 windows) | ~50 min | fixed window count |\n| **Total** | **~10.2 h** | ~1.8 h margin under 12 h |\n\nThe search writes the best `λ`/`n̂` found *so far* whenever it stops — so even if per-eval is slower than expected and it only completes a few generations, you still get a usable result (at minimum it evaluates the PI/NTK/YaRN seeds first, so it can never do worse than YaRN).\n\n## Before launching, confirm 3 things at the top of the script\n- **`ARCH`** = your actual base config (defaulted to `d384/L6/6-2/ffn1024/untied`).\n- **`BASE_MAX_STEPS=1000`** = your base's `CP_MAX_STEPS`.\n- **`GPU=0`** = a GPU that frees when the base finishes (both are on the base now; either works after).\n\n## Knobs if you want a different split\n- More search, tighter finish: `SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=36000` (10h) → ~11.7h total (less margin).\n- Safer margin: `SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=28800` (8h) → ~9.7h total.\n- Bigger extension: `S=8 nohup bash ... &` (4k→32k; eval gets heavier at 32k — keep an eye on the eval memory/time).\n\nLaunch it now — it blocks on the base checkpoint + free GPU, so you can start it and walk away, and it'll land inside your 12h window."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_read_input_tokens":631255,"output_tokens":1771,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":348,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1771,"cache_read_input_tokens":631255,"cache_creation_input_tokens":348,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":348},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdaQMYQRF2awYuFvsu9QH","type":"assistant","uuid":"003e18f4-8101-4f2c-ab2c-759aeee6fd10","timestamp":"2026-07-31T15:52:50.185Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
