{"parentUuid":"54f7e116-8030-42c4-ad86-df1a0d37db8a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbNy8juFGR4yVfe8RHei","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Relaunch — it's ready to fit your 12h\n\nThe crash killed the earlier pipeline (it hit the bad data before search started, so nothing partial was created — no run 200, no factors file). Just relaunch:\n\n```bash\nnohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n```\n\nWhat happens now:\n- It **detects run 20 immediately** (base done) and both GPUs are free → no waiting.\n- Uses **`~/cp_data_clean`** by default (the fixed shard dir).\n- **Search** runs up to 8.5h (`SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=30600`), writing best-so-far when it stops → `longrope_best.txt`.\n- **Fine-tune** (CREAM-composed, 4k physical, ~50 min) → run 200.\n- **Eval** at 16k → `ppl_longrope_x4.csv`.\n- Total ≈ 10.2h with ~1.8h margin.\n\nTwo small notes:\n- If you'd rather the search use the *full* clean data (5 train shards are there), it already will — the fine-tune only needs ~39M tokens and the shards hold 500M.\n- The `~/Downloads` folder is a mess of duplicate/partial downloads; I left it untouched and just symlinked the 6 valid files into `~/cp_data_clean`. Worth cleaning up `~/Downloads` separately at some point (lots of `(1)/(2)` dupes and `.part` files).\n\nThat's it — launch it and it'll land inside your window with the LongRoPE arm ready to overlay against your CREAM/YaRN curves."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1781,"cache_read_input_tokens":647328,"output_tokens":573,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1781,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":573,"cache_read_input_tokens":647328,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1781,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1781},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbNxsLT2oP6R5dDaMtog","type":"assistant","uuid":"0ba8d834-135c-43ef-a926-7fd0a0d9fb6f","timestamp":"2026-08-01T04:14:56.633Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
