{"parentUuid":"a63b6d63-4d58-494b-ae43-c4e260049973","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbP6opajuHKzzEtV5MbP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — pipeline now defaults to `/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data` (syntax OK). That's the same clean root your base run 20 used, so it's fully consistent. The earlier smoke test already proved the resident evaluator, swap-takes-effect, and coupling assert all work; the only thing that was wrong was the data path.\n\n## Relaunch (fits 12h)\n```bash\nnohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n```\n\nIt will now:\n- detect run 20 immediately (base done, GPUs free) → no wait,\n- read from `Data_Loader/Data` (15 clean shards),\n- search ≤8.5h → `longrope_best.txt`, fine-tune (CREAM-composed, 4k) → run 200, eval @16k → `ppl_longrope_x4.csv`.\n\nOptional cleanup: the `~/cp_data_clean` symlink dir I made earlier is now unused — you can `rm -rf ~/cp_data_clean` whenever. And `~/Downloads` still has the broken duplicate downloads, but nothing points there anymore.\n\nYou're clear to launch."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":342,"cache_read_input_tokens":652101,"output_tokens":906,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":342,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":906,"cache_read_input_tokens":652101,"cache_creation_input_tokens":342,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":342},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbP6kY8uRFCgVivKKVFv","type":"assistant","uuid":"332e730c-69e0-4b06-b81b-33e7139b9ef4","timestamp":"2026-08-01T04:16:45.283Z","effort":"low",