{"parentUuid":"c2b524b2-349f-4951-b567-091aad44f64f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbQwpRnDEjRHv4LbiouL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — the LongRoPE pipeline is self-contained. Here's exactly what to ship and how.\n\n## Good news from the check\n- **Driver is stdlib-only** (`argparse/math/os/random/subprocess/sys/tempfile/time`) — no numpy/torch to install.\n- **Build auto-detects the GPU arch** (`SM_ARCH` from `nvidia-smi compute_cap`) — so rebuilding on the server targets its GPU automatically (A100=sm_80, H100=sm_90, 3060=sm_86).\n- Runtime dynamic libs are just `libtensor.so` + `libprofiler.so` (built with the repo).\n\n## Recommended: rebuild on the server (portable)\n\n**Ship (3 things):**\n1. **Source tree** — the whole repo *minus* build artifacts (the build needs `BluTrain/`, `context_parallel/`, `process_group/`, `Scripts/`, `Tests/`, `Makefile`):\n   ```bash\n   rsync -av --exclude 'build/' --exclude '.git/' --exclude 'checkpoints_bluscriptcp/' \\\n         --exclude 'Data_Loader/Data/' /home/blu-bridge25/CP/  SERVER:/path/CP/\n   ```\n2. **Base checkpoint** (551 MB) — or just train a base on the server:\n   ```bash\n   rsync -av checkpoints_bluscriptcp/blumodelcp_run20_step_*  SERVER:/path/CP/checkpoints_bluscriptcp/\n   ```\n3. **Data** (3 GB full, but you don't need all of it — fine-tune uses <1 shard, eval uses val):\n   ```bash\n   # minimal: 3 train shards + val is plenty\n   rsync -av Data_Loader/Data/edufineweb_train_00000{1,2,3}.bin \\\n             Data_Loader/Data/edufineweb_val_00000.bin  SERVER:/path/CP/Data_Loader/Data/\n   ```\n\n**Server prerequisites:** CUDA toolkit + matching driver, OpenMPI (`mpirun`), NCCL, `python3`. (No pip packages needed for the driver.)\n\n**On the server:**\n```bash\ncd /path/CP\nmake CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 bluscript-cp cp-rope-longrope          # arch auto-detected\nLD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib \\\n  ./build/cp_rope_longrope_parity_exec                       # sanity: parity should PASS\nnohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > lr.log 2>&1 &\n```\n\n## If the server already has the CP repo checked out\nJust sync the **8 LongRoPE files** and rebuild — no full-tree copy:\n```\ncontext_parallel/LongRoPEOps.h          (new)\ncontext_parallel/YARNOps.cpp            (modified)\nScripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp        (modified)\nTests/cp_rope_longrope_parity.cpp       (new)\nTests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py    (new)\nTests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh (new)\nMakefile                                (modified)\nREADME.md                               (modified)\n```\n\n## Alternative: ship the prebuilt binary (only if arch matches)\nIf the server has the **same GPU arch + CUDA/NCCL/MPI versions**, you can skip building and ship `build/bluscriptCP_exec` + `BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib/libtensor.so` + `BluTrain/Profiler/lib/libprofiler.so` + ckpt + data + the two `Tests/bluscriptcp/*.py/.sh`. Riskier (version/arch mismatch → segfault), so rebuild-on-server is safer.\n\n## Adjust on the server\nEdit the top of `run_longrope_pipeline.sh` (or override via env):\n- `DATA_ROOT` → the server's data path,\n- `GPU` → a free device,\n- `ARCH`/`BASE_MAX_STEPS` → match your base,\n- `SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC` → the server's time budget (bigger GPU → each eval faster → more generations fit).\n\nSo: **source + one checkpoint + a few data shards + `make` + launch the pipeline.** That's the whole bundle."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3094,"cache_read_input_tokens":653372,"output_tokens":2862,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3094,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2862,"cache_read_input_tokens":653372,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3094,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3094},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbQwguqfHRkoSWFTnNs6","type":"assistant","uuid":"b72c1266-c679-4769-bbd2-1892528bfcfd","timestamp":"2026-08-01T04:41:19.280Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
