{"parentUuid":"28c06f33-2caa-40e0-8622-6db82c3ca013","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbR7YuARsRqm3VCRghBT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two-part answer — and let me actually **measure** the per-eval time at 16k so the estimates are real, not guessed (GPUs are free right now).\n\n## 1. Single GPU — yes, as shipped\nThe whole pipeline is `CP_SIZE=1` because: the resident evaluator and `CP_EVAL_PPL` both require it (per-position NLL with no cross-rank gather), and the CREAM-composed fine-tune is single-GPU (CREAM's deferred multi-GPU). So it runs on **one** GPU.\n\n**But the search is embarrassingly parallel** — thousands of *independent* candidate evals. I could shard candidates across N GPUs (N resident evaluators) for ~N× search speedup; the driver currently uses one. That's the main multi-GPU lever if you want it.\n\nLet me measure the actual cost:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3015,"cache_read_input_tokens":656466,"output_tokens":3459,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3459,"cache_read_input_tokens":656466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbR7TUjV6TNfFuJMKEu7","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff3591f7-72d6-46cf-8597-86810bdab97c","timestamp":"2026-08-01T04:43:36.512Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"ff3591f7-72d6-46cf-8597-86810bdab97c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbR7YuARsRqm3VCRghBT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011LUzWDifqy2ewxfh2aiut7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/blu-bridge25/CP\npython3 - <<'PY'\nhalf=32\ndef w(p,lam):\n    open(p,'w').write(\"n_hat 0\\ns 4\\nS_search 16384\\nlambda \"+\" \".join(f\"{lam:.2f}\" for _ in range(half))+\"\\n\")\nfor i,l in enumerate([1.0,2.0,3.0]): w(f\"/tmp/lrsmoke/c{i}.txt\",l)\nPY\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\n# time 3 candidates at target 16384, CALIB=3; print a timestamp before each PPL line\nprintf '/tmp/lrsmoke/c0.txt\\n/tmp/lrsmoke/c1.txt\\n/tmp/lrsmoke/c2.txt\\n' | \\\n  env $ARCH CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH=1 CP_T=16384 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=3 \\\n      CP_CKPT_RESUME=20 CP_DATA_ROOT=/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 \\\n      LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n      mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec 2>&1 | grep --line-buffered -E \"resident evaluator ready|^PPL \" | while read line; do echo \"$(date +%s.%N) | $line\"; done","description":"Measure per-candidate eval time at 16384"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3015,"cache_read_input_tokens":656466,"output_tokens":3459,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3459,"cache_read_input_tokens":656466,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics"