{"parentUuid":"dcd73b9c-88b8-44a3-aa6d-65089501f8f6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a67f378f-797a-4951-952d-5d69350af4bf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Request interrupted by user]"}]},"uuid":"c8972252-38b1-4cbb-8928-0e6518749f66","timestamp":"2026-08-01T05:20:51.304Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"c8972252-38b1-4cbb-8928-0e6518749f66","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"eb0df96f-5a92-478a-aae3-9946c7945628","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have a checkpoint of this Configuration (base model ) (bluscriptCP):\n  d_model: 384\n  n_layers: 6\n  q_heads: 6\n  kv_heads: 2  (G=3, head_dim=64)\n  ffn_hidden: 1024\n  context_length: 4096\n  vocab_size: 50304  (tying=0)\n  B: 2\n  T: 4096\n  world_size: 1  (dp=1 x cp=1)\n  CP_ATTN_MODE: ulysses  (load_balance=contiguous)\n  global_batch: 524288\n  grad_accum_steps: 64\n  Parameters: 48076416\n  Parameters per GPU: 48076416\n  Max Learning Rate: 0.0006\n  Min Learning Rate: 6e-05\n  max_steps: 917\n  warmup_steps: 91\n  checkpointing: 1\n  ckpt_freq: 50\n  run: 30\nin the server, can I use this to run this ? how much time would it take with 2 6000 Ada GPUs"}]},"uuid":"dc5ad495-23ed-4de2-912e-883fd066f140","timestamp":"2026-08-01T05:21:14.667Z","permissionMode":"acceptEdits","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
