{"parentUuid":"dc82a635-d730-467d-b0b0-0ce0f9bfe4ee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbUjQK5o5ueEsjtjVAKj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — **s=16 (64k) is the sweet spot for your hardware**, and better than you might think: it **fits on a single 6000 Ada**, so you need *neither* CREAM *nor* CP.\n\n## Why s=16 is clean on one 48 GB GPU\n- **Search/eval forward** at 64k: logits `[1, 65536, 50304]` fp32 ≈ **13 GB** — fits easily on 48 GB. So the CP=2 limitation I described (which bites at 256k) **doesn't apply at 64k**. Single GPU is fine.\n- **LongRoPE-alone fine-tune** at 64k physical (fwd+bwd): ~**30–40 GB** with `B=1` — should fit the 48 GB, tight but doable. This is the only memory-sensitive stage.\n\nSo at s=16 you get the **faithful, no-CREAM LongRoPE** run on one GPU — you sidestep both the CREAM approximation and the CP-eval gap entirely.\n\n## The one code change needed\nThe pipeline currently **hardcodes the CREAM-composed fine-tune**. For no-CREAM you need the LongRoPE-alone path. Let me add the toggle — I'll do it now."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8202,"cache_read_input_tokens":699772,"output_tokens":3188,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8202,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3188,"cache_read_input_tokens":699772,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8202,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8202},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbUjKgH2uFaENfcgrwbR","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d5dd79d-bcec-4044-88e4-bfdc7fe9fc8d","timestamp":"2026-08-01T05:31:05.833Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
