{"parentUuid":"b3b95878-4cb6-4c17-82e6-ec106b1b4604","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/.mdfiles/output.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/.mdfiles/output.md","content":"blubridge@blubridge:/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism$ cd /mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nprintf 'n_hat 0\\ns 16\\nS_search 65536\\nlambda %s\\n' \"$(python3 -c \"print(' '.join(['1.00']*32))\")\" > /tmp/c.txt\nprintf '/tmp/c.txt\\n' | env $ARCH CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH=1 CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=1 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec 2>&1 | tail -40\n=== Llama Context Parallel Training Script (bluscriptCP) ===\n[CP attn mode] ULYSSES (all-to-all); load_balancing forced off (contiguous sharding)\n================ Configuration (bluscriptCP) ================\n  d_model/layers  : 384 / 6\n  q/kv heads      : 6 / 2  (G=3, hd=64)\n  ffn_hidden      : 1024 (SwiGLU)\n  context_length  : 65536\n  vocab_size      : 50304  tying=0\n  B x T           : 1 x 65536\n  world_size      : 1  (dp=1 x cp=1)\n  CP_ATTN_MODE    : ulysses  (load_balance=contiguous)\n  global_batch    : 524288  (grad_accum=8)\n  max_lr/min_lr   : 0.0006 / 6e-05\n  warmup/steps    : 91 / 917\n  checkpointing   : true  (ckpt_freq=50, dir=checkpoints_bluscriptcp)\n=============================================================\nInitializing model on CUDA device 0...\n[YaRN] build_rope_cache: seq_len=65536 hd=64 scale=1.000 low=3 high=13 m=1.0000\nParameters: 48076416\nParameters per GPU: 48076416\nmax_steps: 917\nwarmup_steps: 91\nfound 15 shards for split train\nfound 1 shards for split val\nSaving logs to: CP_BluScreipt_Training_logs/CP_Training_log30.csv (resume run 30)\nCheckpointing: ON -> checkpoints_bluscriptcp/blumodelcp_run30_step_<N>.ckpt (every 50 steps, keep 6)\n[CheckpointManager] Auto-loading latest: checkpoints_bluscriptcp/blumodelcp_run30_step_917.ckpt\n[Resume] run 30 from step 917 (loss 5.20233)\n[resume] fast-forwarded data loader 7336 batches (480772096 tokens)\n\nStarting training...\n\n","numLines":41,"startLine":1,"totalLines":41}},"displayPath":".mdfiles/output.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"34cb17f8-15ef-4c08-98e9-2118091594e6","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:47:22.804Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
