{"parentUuid":"a5e8a89f-08ad-4445-abb6-758db8ae8d52","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbac9aZWATRV7oRg32rH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"output_tokens":3729,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3729,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdbac4tnED7wWPM59jnAf","type":"assistant","uuid":"62746f79-67a2-4a90-961e-35c35b430d82","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:01.109Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"62746f79-67a2-4a90-961e-35c35b430d82","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbac9aZWATRV7oRg32rH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The output reveals the **real problem** — and it's not memory. Look at lines 33-39: the binary **resumed run 30 and went straight into \"Starting training...\"** — it never entered the resident search evaluator (no `[longrope-search] resident evaluator ready` line). That means:\n\n**The server's `./build/bluscriptCP_exec` is a STALE build** — compiled *before* the LongRoPE resident-evaluator code. It doesn't recognize `CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH`, so it falls through to normal training. That's also why the pipeline's search \"died\" — the driver fed candidate paths to a training process and never got `PPL` back.\n\n## Fix: sync the LongRoPE source to the server and rebuild\nThe server has the old binary. Sync these files and rebuild:\n```\ncontext_parallel/LongRoPEOps.h            (new)\ncontext_parallel/YARNOps.cpp              (modified)\nScripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp          (modified - has the resident evaluator)\nMakefile                                  (modified)\nTests/cp_rope_longrope_parity.cpp         (new)\nTests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py      (new)\nTests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh (new)\n```\nThen on the server:\n```bash\nmake CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 bluscript-cp cp-rope-longrope\nLD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib ./build/cp_rope_longrope_parity_exec   # sanity: parity PASS\n```\nAfter rebuild, re-run the manual diagnostic — you should see `[longrope-search] resident evaluator ready` then `PPL <v>`, confirming the new code is live.\n\n## Second request: checkpoint numbering (start at 80, never overwrite)\nLet me make the fine-tune run number **start at 80 and auto-increment to the first free number** so it never clobbers an existing checkpoint:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"output_tokens":3729,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3729,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdbac4tnED7wWPM59jnAf","type":"assistant","uuid":"75c8b15c-44e5-4c62-9c9a-7b3d78f743d5","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:09.607Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"75c8b15c-44e5-4c62-9c9a-7b3d78f743d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbac9aZWATRV7oRg32rH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh","old_string":"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint","new_string":"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"output_tokens":3729,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3729,"cache_read_input_tokens":734245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2689,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2689},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdbac4tnED7wWPM59jnAf","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d4d2057-eafb-4860-9db7-0f679106391f","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:11.585Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"8d4d2057-eafb-4860-9db7-0f679106391f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"17dab3da-fd84-4b1d-83d9-46e43bea9156","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:12.649Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh","oldString":"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint","newString":"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)","originalFile":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# =============================================================================\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\n#\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n#\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\n# =============================================================================\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../..\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\n\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\nARCH=${ARCH:-\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"}\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\n\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n\nlog(){ echo \"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\"; }\nrun_bin(){ env \"$@\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \"$EXE\"; }\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\n  while :; do\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \"$GPU\" | tr -d ' ')\n    [ \"${free:-0}\" -ge 4000 ] && break\n    log \"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\"; sleep 20\n  done\n}\n\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\nif [ -n \"$BASE_RUN\" ]; then\n  log \"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\"\n  while :; do\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\n    [ -n \"$BASE_CKPT\" ] && break\n    log \"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\"; sleep 30\n  done\nelse\n  log \"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\"\n  BASE_CKPT=\"\"\n  while :; do\n    latest=$(ls -1t \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\n    if [ -n \"$latest\" ]; then\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\.ckpt/\\1/' <<<\"$latest\")\n      if [ \"${step:-0}\" -ge \"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\"$latest\"; break; fi\n    fi\n    sleep 30\n  done\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\1#\" <<<\"$BASE_CKPT\")\nfi\nlog \"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\"\nwait_gpu_free\n\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\nlog \"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\"\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\n    --exec \"$EXE\" --ckpt-run \"$BASE_RUN\" \\\n    --target-t \"$TARGET_T\" --s \"$S\" --head-dim \"$HEAD_DIM\" --orig-maxpos \"$ORIG_MAXPOS\" \\\n    --data-root \"$DATA_ROOT\" --cuda-devices \"$GPU\" --arch \"$ARCH\" \\\n    --pop \"$POP\" --n1 \"$N1\" --n2 \"$N2\" --iters \"$ITERS\" --calib-windows \"$CALIB\" \\\n    --patience \"$PATIENCE\" --tol \"$TOL\" \\\n    --time-budget-sec \"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\" --out longrope_best.txt\nlog \"search done -> longrope_best.txt\"; wait_gpu_free\n\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\nif [ \"$COMPOSE\" = \"none\" ]; then\n  log \"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\"\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\nelse\n  if ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    log \"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\"; exit 1\n  fi\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"\n  for f in \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \"$f\" \"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\"; done\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\n  if [ \"$COMPOSE\" = \"alone\" ]; then\n    log \"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\"\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\n  else  # cream\n    log \"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\"\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\n  fi\n  log \"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\"; wait_gpu_free\nfi\n\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\nlog \"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\"\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\nlog \"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\"\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":28,"oldLines":7,"newStart":28,"newLines":7,"lines":[" ORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}"," DATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)"," GPU=${GPU:-0}","-FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint","+FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)"," FT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base"," FT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)"," EVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"62067085-6210-4f07-b170-0a658ac35ed7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"17dab3da-fd84-4b1d-83d9-46e43bea9156","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"new_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"newString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":28,\"oldLines\":7,\"newStart\":28,\"newLines\":7,\"lines\":[\" ORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\",\" DATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\",\" GPU=${GPU:-0}\",\"-FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"+FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\" FT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\",\" FT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\",\" EVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22\",\"duration_ms\":7}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:format\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-format.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":19},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c1c1b463-7d45-480e-8e5f-e26db0594889","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:11.667Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"c1c1b463-7d45-480e-8e5f-e26db0594889","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"new_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"newString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":28,\"oldLines\":7,\"newStart\":28,\"newLines\":7,\"lines\":[\" ORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\",\" DATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\",\" GPU=${GPU:-0}\",\"-FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"+FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\" FT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\",\" FT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\",\" EVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22\",\"duration_ms\":7}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:console-warn\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-console-warn.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":39},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b8854805-8143-4d2d-b144-30f5b420aab5","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:11.686Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"b8854805-8143-4d2d-b144-30f5b420aab5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"new_string\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"newString\":\"FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":28,\"oldLines\":7,\"newStart\":28,\"newLines\":7,\"lines\":[\" ORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\",\" DATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\",\" GPU=${GPU:-0}\",\"-FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-200}            # run number for the fine-tuned checkpoint\",\"+FT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\",\" FT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\",\" FT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\",\" EVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_013DNyYsovawqm8USS19AA22\",\"duration_ms\":7}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:typecheck\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-typecheck.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":44},"type":"attachment","uuid":"667b12eb-e209-4b01-8ff6-abe5087ef5f8","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:11.691Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"667b12eb-e209-4b01-8ff6-abe5087ef5f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbafog6sFXy3VB22YZsM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh","old_string":"else\n  if ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    log \"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\"; exit 1\n  fi\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"","new_string":"else\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\n  while ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \"$FT_RUN\" = \"$BASE_RUN\" ]; do\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\n  done\n  log \"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\"\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\""},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3800,"cache_read_input_tokens":736934,"output_tokens":505,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3800,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":505,"cache_read_input_tokens":736934,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3800,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3800},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbafkDVXsYwGKuBrhTUM","type":"assistant","uuid":"713a69a1-1a55-425c-a037-9c1679c321b0","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:20.613Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"713a69a1-1a55-425c-a037-9c1679c321b0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"af030990-a4f1-400c-953f-b497de6ed91e","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:21.667Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh","oldString":"else\n  if ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    log \"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\"; exit 1\n  fi\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"","newString":"else\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\n  while ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \"$FT_RUN\" = \"$BASE_RUN\" ]; do\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\n  done\n  log \"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\"\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"","originalFile":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# =============================================================================\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\n#\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\n#\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\n# =============================================================================\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")/../..\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\n\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\nARCH=${ARCH:-\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"}\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\n\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n\nlog(){ echo \"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\"; }\nrun_bin(){ env \"$@\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \"$EXE\"; }\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\n  while :; do\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \"$GPU\" | tr -d ' ')\n    [ \"${free:-0}\" -ge 4000 ] && break\n    log \"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\"; sleep 20\n  done\n}\n\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\nif [ -n \"$BASE_RUN\" ]; then\n  log \"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\"\n  while :; do\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\n    [ -n \"$BASE_CKPT\" ] && break\n    log \"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\"; sleep 30\n  done\nelse\n  log \"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\"\n  BASE_CKPT=\"\"\n  while :; do\n    latest=$(ls -1t \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\n    if [ -n \"$latest\" ]; then\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\.ckpt/\\1/' <<<\"$latest\")\n      if [ \"${step:-0}\" -ge \"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\"$latest\"; break; fi\n    fi\n    sleep 30\n  done\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\1#\" <<<\"$BASE_CKPT\")\nfi\nlog \"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\"\nwait_gpu_free\n\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\nlog \"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\"\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\n    --exec \"$EXE\" --ckpt-run \"$BASE_RUN\" \\\n    --target-t \"$TARGET_T\" --s \"$S\" --head-dim \"$HEAD_DIM\" --orig-maxpos \"$ORIG_MAXPOS\" \\\n    --data-root \"$DATA_ROOT\" --cuda-devices \"$GPU\" --arch \"$ARCH\" \\\n    --pop \"$POP\" --n1 \"$N1\" --n2 \"$N2\" --iters \"$ITERS\" --calib-windows \"$CALIB\" \\\n    --patience \"$PATIENCE\" --tol \"$TOL\" \\\n    --time-budget-sec \"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\" --out longrope_best.txt\nlog \"search done -> longrope_best.txt\"; wait_gpu_free\n\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\nif [ \"$COMPOSE\" = \"none\" ]; then\n  log \"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\"\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\nelse\n  if ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n    log \"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\"; exit 1\n  fi\n  log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"\n  for f in \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \"$f\" \"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\"; done\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\n  if [ \"$COMPOSE\" = \"alone\" ]; then\n    log \"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\"\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\n  else  # cream\n    log \"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\"\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\n  fi\n  log \"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\"; wait_gpu_free\nfi\n\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\nlog \"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\"\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\nlog \"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\"\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":103,"oldLines":9,"newStart":103,"newLines":12,"lines":["   log \"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\"","   EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN"," else","-  if ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then","-    log \"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\"; exit 1","-  fi","+  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number","+  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.","+  while ls \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \"$FT_RUN\" = \"$BASE_RUN\" ]; do","+    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))","+  done","+  log \"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\"","   log \"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\"","   for f in \"$CKPT_DIR\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \"$f\" \"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\"; done","   FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5f058a6b-b638-4f49-a304-23e462ba9769","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"af030990-a4f1-400c-953f-b497de6ed91e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"newString\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":103,\"oldLines\":9,\"newStart\":103,\"newLines\":12,\"lines\":[\"   log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\",\"   EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\",\" else\",\"-  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\",\"-    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\",\"-  fi\",\"+  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\",\"+  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\",\"+  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\",\"+    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\",\"+  done\",\"+  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\",\"   log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"   for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\",\"   FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx\",\"duration_ms\":2}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:format\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-format.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":37},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fa49d551-d043-4bcd-93df-848dfbf530e8","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:20.701Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"fa49d551-d043-4bcd-93df-848dfbf530e8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"newString\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":103,\"oldLines\":9,\"newStart\":103,\"newLines\":12,\"lines\":[\"   log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\",\"   EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\",\" else\",\"-  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\",\"-    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\",\"-  fi\",\"+  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\",\"+  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\",\"+  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\",\"+    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\",\"+  done\",\"+  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\",\"   log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"   for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\",\"   FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx\",\"duration_ms\":2}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:typecheck\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-typecheck.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":49},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ad52a4ed-6f21-4066-9080-ad2558dd65c1","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:20.713Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"ad52a4ed-6f21-4066-9080-ad2558dd65c1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PostToolUse:Edit","toolUseID":"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"session_id\":\"3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b\",\"transcript_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/.claude/projects/-home-blu-bridge25-CP/3d0a11bb-de89-4095-8132-fc46c7f9936b.jsonl\",\"cwd\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP\",\"prompt_id\":\"9b99e596-84a9-425e-b960-8cee7897587a\",\"permission_mode\":\"acceptEdits\",\"effort\":{\"level\":\"low\"},\"hook_event_name\":\"PostToolUse\",\"tool_name\":\"Edit\",\"tool_input\":{\"file_path\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"old_string\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"new_string\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"replace_all\":false},\"tool_response\":{\"filePath\":\"/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh\",\"oldString\":\"else\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"newString\":\"else\\n  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\\n  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\\n  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\\n    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\\n  done\\n  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"originalFile\":\"#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# =============================================================================\\n# run_longrope_pipeline.sh -- wait for the base run to finish, then run the full\\n# LongRoPE pipeline automatically:\\n#   1. wait for the base checkpoint (step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS) + a free GPU\\n#   2. LongRoPE evolutionary search  -> longrope_best.txt\\n#   3. branch base -> FT_RUN, CREAM-composed fine-tune (cheap 4k-physical)\\n#   4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length -> ppl_longrope_x<S>.csv\\n#\\n# Launch it NOW (while the base trains); it blocks on step 1 until the base is done.\\n#   nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > longrope_pipeline.log 2>&1 &\\n#   tail -f longrope_pipeline.log\\n#\\n# Override any UPPER_CASE var via env, e.g.:  S=8 POP=32 ITERS=20 bash ...run_longrope_pipeline.sh\\n# =============================================================================\\nset -euo pipefail\\ncd \\\"$(dirname \\\"$0\\\")/../..\\\"   # -> repo root (CP/)\\n\\n# ---- config (edit or override via env) --------------------------------------\\nCKPT_DIR=${CKPT_DIR:-checkpoints_bluscriptcp}\\nPREFIX=${PREFIX:-blumodelcp}\\nARCH=${ARCH:-\\\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\\\"}\\nGBATCH=${GBATCH:-131072}          # tokens/step (keep same as base for comparability)\\nBASE_MAX_STEPS=${BASE_MAX_STEPS:-1000}\\nPHYS_T=${PHYS_T:-4096}            # physical training length (base context)\\nS=${S:-4}                        # extension factor (4k -> 16k). MUST be integer >= 2\\nHEAD_DIM=${HEAD_DIM:-64}\\nORIG_MAXPOS=${ORIG_MAXPOS:-$PHYS_T}\\nDATA_ROOT=${DATA_ROOT:-/home/blu-bridge25/CP/Data_Loader/Data}   # clean shard dir (15 train + val)\\nGPU=${GPU:-0}\\nFT_RUN=${FT_RUN:-80}             # start numbering new fine-tuned checkpoints here (auto-increments if taken)\\nFT_STEPS=${FT_STEPS:-300}        # fine-tune steps on top of base\\nFT_B=${FT_B:-1}                  # micro-batch for the fine-tune (1 for long-physical alone)\\nEVAL_WINDOWS=${EVAL_WINDOWS:-32}\\n# COMPOSE = how the fine-tune uses the searched cache:\\n#   alone : LongRoPE-alone, fine-tune at the FULL target length (faithful; needs memory)\\n#   cream : LongRoPE cache as CREAM gather source, fine-tune at 4k physical (cheap)\\n#   none  : NO fine-tune -- eval the base ckpt directly with the searched cache (search-only)\\nCOMPOSE=${COMPOSE:-alone}\\n# search knobs -- RIGHT-SIZED for this model, not the paper's 7B/512x scale.\\n# head_dim/2 search dims (32 here) + PI/NTK/YaRN seeds converge fast, so a small\\n# GA with EARLY-STOPPING runs only as much as the model needs. PATIENCE stops when\\n# best PPL stalls; SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC is a hard wall-clock ceiling as a backstop.\\n# (For a paper-scale search set POP=64 ITERS=40 N1=16 N2=16 PATIENCE=0.)\\nPOP=${POP:-16}; N1=${N1:-8}; N2=${N2:-8}; ITERS=${ITERS:-20}; CALIB=${CALIB:-3}\\nPATIENCE=${PATIENCE:-4}; TOL=${TOL:-0.05}\\nSEARCH_BUDGET_SEC=${SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC:-30600}   # 8.5h hard ceiling (early-stop usually hits first)\\n\\nTARGET_T=$(( PHYS_T * S ))       # search/eval target length (= factor*T for the composed path)\\nexport LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}\\nEXE=./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n\\nlog(){ echo \\\"[$(date '+%H:%M:%S')] $*\\\"; }\\nrun_bin(){ env \\\"$@\\\" CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=$GPU mpirun -np 1 \\\"$EXE\\\"; }\\nwait_gpu_free(){  # block until GPU has >= 4 GB free\\n  while :; do\\n    local free; free=$(nvidia-smi --query-gpu=memory.free --format=csv,noheader,nounits -i \\\"$GPU\\\" | tr -d ' ')\\n    [ \\\"${free:-0}\\\" -ge 4000 ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for GPU $GPU to free (free=${free}MB) ...\\\"; sleep 20\\n  done\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 1. wait for base checkpoint at step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS -------------------\\n# BASE_RUN can be set explicitly (e.g. BASE_RUN=30); otherwise auto-detect the\\n# newest checkpoint whose top step >= BASE_MAX_STEPS.\\nBASE_RUN=${BASE_RUN:-}\\nif [ -n \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"using explicit BASE_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    BASE_CKPT=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    [ -n \\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\" ] && break\\n    log \\\"waiting for run $BASE_RUN checkpoint ...\\\"; sleep 30\\n  done\\nelse\\n  log \\\"waiting for base checkpoint (step >= $BASE_MAX_STEPS) in $CKPT_DIR ...\\\"\\n  BASE_CKPT=\\\"\\\"\\n  while :; do\\n    latest=$(ls -1t \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run*_step_*.ckpt 2>/dev/null | head -1 || true)\\n    if [ -n \\\"$latest\\\" ]; then\\n      step=$(sed -E 's/.*_step_([0-9]+)\\\\.ckpt/\\\\1/' <<<\\\"$latest\\\")\\n      if [ \\\"${step:-0}\\\" -ge \\\"$BASE_MAX_STEPS\\\" ]; then BASE_CKPT=\\\"$latest\\\"; break; fi\\n    fi\\n    sleep 30\\n  done\\n  BASE_RUN=$(sed -E \\\"s#.*/${PREFIX}_run([0-9]+)_step_.*#\\\\1#\\\" <<<\\\"$BASE_CKPT\\\")\\nfi\\nlog \\\"base done: run $BASE_RUN  ($BASE_CKPT)\\\"\\nwait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 2. LongRoPE search -----------------------------------------------------\\nlog \\\"LongRoPE search: target=$TARGET_T s=$S  (POP=$POP ITERS=$ITERS CALIB=$CALIB)\\\"\\npython3 Tests/bluscriptcp/longrope_search.py \\\\\\n    --exec \\\"$EXE\\\" --ckpt-run \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" \\\\\\n    --target-t \\\"$TARGET_T\\\" --s \\\"$S\\\" --head-dim \\\"$HEAD_DIM\\\" --orig-maxpos \\\"$ORIG_MAXPOS\\\" \\\\\\n    --data-root \\\"$DATA_ROOT\\\" --cuda-devices \\\"$GPU\\\" --arch \\\"$ARCH\\\" \\\\\\n    --pop \\\"$POP\\\" --n1 \\\"$N1\\\" --n2 \\\"$N2\\\" --iters \\\"$ITERS\\\" --calib-windows \\\"$CALIB\\\" \\\\\\n    --patience \\\"$PATIENCE\\\" --tol \\\"$TOL\\\" \\\\\\n    --time-budget-sec \\\"$SEARCH_BUDGET_SEC\\\" --out longrope_best.txt\\nlog \\\"search done -> longrope_best.txt\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\n\\n# ---- 3. fine-tune with the searched cache (COMPOSE selects how) --------------\\nif [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"none\\\" ]; then\\n  log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\\n  EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\\nelse\\n  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\\n    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\\n  for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\\n  FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\\n  EVAL_RUN=$FT_RUN\\n  if [ \\\"$COMPOSE\\\" = \\\"alone\\\" ]; then\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE-ALONE at full length T=$TARGET_T (no CREAM) run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=$FT_B CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  else  # cream\\n    log \\\"fine-tune LongRoPE+CREAM at 4k physical run $FT_RUN -> step $FT_MAX\\\"\\n    run_bin $ARCH CP_T=$PHYS_T CP_B=2 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=$GBATCH \\\\\\n        CP_CREAM_MODE=cream CP_CREAM_SIGMA=3.0 \\\\\\n        YARN_SCALE=$S YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=$ORIG_MAXPOS CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\\\\n        CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=$FT_RUN CP_MAX_STEPS=$FT_MAX \\\\\\n        CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\n  fi\\n  log \\\"fine-tune done (run $FT_RUN)\\\"; wait_gpu_free\\nfi\\n\\n# ---- 4. eval the LongRoPE arm at the target length --------------------------\\nOUT=ppl_longrope_x${S}_${COMPOSE}.csv\\nlog \\\"eval PPL-vs-position at T=$TARGET_T (run $EVAL_RUN) -> $OUT\\\"\\nrun_bin $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=$TARGET_T CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=$EVAL_WINDOWS \\\\\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=$EVAL_RUN \\\\\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=$OUT CP_DATA_ROOT=$DATA_ROOT\\nlog \\\"DONE. wrote $OUT  (overlay with your CREAM/YaRN curves in graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb)\\\"\\n\",\"structuredPatch\":[{\"oldStart\":103,\"oldLines\":9,\"newStart\":103,\"newLines\":12,\"lines\":[\"   log \\\"COMPOSE=none: skipping fine-tune -- will eval the BASE ckpt (run $BASE_RUN) with the searched cache\\\"\",\"   EVAL_RUN=$BASE_RUN\",\" else\",\"-  if ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1; then\",\"-    log \\\"ERROR: run $FT_RUN already exists in $CKPT_DIR -- set FT_RUN to a free number\\\"; exit 1\",\"-  fi\",\"+  # never overwrite an existing checkpoint: bump FT_RUN to the first free run number\",\"+  # (>= the starting value, default 80). Also avoids colliding with the base run.\",\"+  while ls \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${FT_RUN}_* >/dev/null 2>&1 || [ \\\"$FT_RUN\\\" = \\\"$BASE_RUN\\\" ]; do\",\"+    FT_RUN=$(( FT_RUN + 1 ))\",\"+  done\",\"+  log \\\"fine-tuned checkpoint will be run $FT_RUN (first free >= start)\\\"\",\"   log \\\"branching base run $BASE_RUN -> $FT_RUN\\\"\",\"   for f in \\\"$CKPT_DIR\\\"/${PREFIX}_run${BASE_RUN}_*; do cp \\\"$f\\\" \\\"${f/run${BASE_RUN}/run${FT_RUN}}\\\"; done\",\"   FT_MAX=$(( BASE_MAX_STEPS + FT_STEPS ))\"]}],\"userModified\":false,\"replaceAll\":false},\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01JWPwXjtmp4tKJpdErvwwSx\",\"duration_ms\":2}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"post:edit:console-warn\" \"scripts/hooks/post-edit-console-warn.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":59},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cbf2fb7e-a9a4-4475-9f42-d8121250c108","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:48:20.723Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sess