{"parentUuid":"af762b39-80ca-426d-85f1-2969055bf3f7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbagxp4ELSm4tTcj4Xt3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`bash OK`. Both issues handled:\n\n## 1. The real blocker: stale server binary → **rebuild on the server**\nThe output proves it — the binary resumed run 30 and printed \"Starting training...\" instead of the resident evaluator. The server's `bluscriptCP_exec` predates the LongRoPE code, so `CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH` isn't recognized. **Rebuild it:**\n```bash\ncd /mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism\nmake CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 bluscript-cp cp-rope-longrope\n```\nIf the build fails (missing symbols), the LongRoPE **source** isn't synced either — sync the 7 files I listed, then rebuild. Verify with the manual diagnostic afterward: you should now see `[longrope-search] resident evaluator ready` followed by `PPL <v>` (not \"Starting training...\").\n\n**Good news — nothing got damaged:** those runs resumed run 30 at step 917 with `CP_MAX_STEPS=917`, so the training loop ran **0 steps** (start == max) and saved no checkpoints. Run 30 is intact.\n\n## 2. Checkpoint numbering — starts at 80, never overwrites\nUpdated the pipeline: the fine-tuned checkpoint run number now **starts at 80 and auto-increments to the first free number**, skipping any existing run and the base run itself. So it can never clobber run 30 or any prior checkpoint. (Sync the updated `run_longrope_pipeline.sh` to the server too.)\n\n## After rebuilding, re-launch\n```bash\nBASE_RUN=30 BASE_MAX_STEPS=917 GPU=5 S=16 COMPOSE=alone \\\n  DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n  nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > lr_s16_alone.log 2>&1 &\n```\n(The fine-tune checkpoint will land at run 80, or the next free number.)\n\nOne note now that I can see it: your base is `CP_ATTN_MODE: ulysses`. The rebuild + resident evaluator run in **ring** mode by default (what LongRoPE was tested against) — resuming the ulysses checkpoint there is fine (weights are identical, RoPE is computed). If you'd rather keep everything ulysses, that path *should* also work via `set_rope_cache` (it syncs the ulysses cache), but ring is the tested one. Rebuild first, run the diagnostic, and paste the result if anything still looks off."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_read_input_tokens":741433,"output_tokens":2474,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2474,"cache_read_input_tokens":741433,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbagtQ9EsLWdoviF7SNe","type":"assistant","uuid":"f2aeccd8-b996-4c1d-9f9c-040d5d83faba","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:49:07.305Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
