{"parentUuid":"cc64f355-8779-40bb-970d-4c19ce512e06","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbaznyTpfGwdPt7kyrmc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Step 3 — untrack the already-committed artifacts** (run once on one machine, commit, push; the other pulls):\n```bash\ngit rm -r --cached --ignore-unmatch .mdfiles\ngit ls-files '*.log' | xargs -r git rm --cached\ngit add .gitignore .gitattributes\ngit commit -m \"chore: stop tracking generated logs + scratch outputs; ignore *.log/**/logs\"\ngit push\n```\nThis removes them from git but **keeps the files on disk**. After this, they never conflict again.\n\nLet me also make the notebook rule cover *any* notebook (not just the two named), so new ones don't reintroduce the problem:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3312,"cache_read_input_tokens":748135,"output_tokens":1813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1813,"cache_read_input_tokens":748135,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3312},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdbazj268P8dyEYpc8Csn","type":"assistant","uuid":"fa7ab563-b81e-4c41-836b-acd73afe6f24","timestamp":"2026-08-01T06:52:55.416Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
