{"parentUuid":"68fc64f1-574c-4792-8ed6-f8c1e4d53ee7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbbahxY19z81boVDgDZk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Simple fix — `--no-edit` needs a pre-existing message (from an in-progress *merge*), but your conflict came from a **stash pop**, which doesn't set one → empty message → abort. The unmerged files *are* resolved now (otherwise git would complain about those, not the message). Just give it a message with `-m`:\n\n```bash\ngit commit -m \"chore: stop tracking generated logs/pyc/scratch outputs; ignore them\"\ngit push\n```\n\nThat completes it. Then on your **local** machine:\n```bash\ngit config merge.keep-local.driver true   # if not already done here\ngit pull\n```\n\nAfter this both machines are clean: logs, `*.pyc`, `__pycache__/`, and `.mdfiles` are untracked and ignored, and notebooks auto-keep-local — so no more stash/pull/pop dance."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1995,"cache_read_input_tokens":768808,"output_tokens":1066,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1995,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1066,"cache_read_input_tokens":768808,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1995},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbbadSvjh7cMWB5Q5muX","type":"assistant","uuid":"d6585bbd-a3af-4036-8c67-415985db1097","timestamp":"2026-08-01T07:00:27.331Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
