{"parentUuid":"60cdbe7a-9447-4ec8-840f-120e1b9fb8fd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbibJ2UCP7YPxRg1Ckpi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The **merge is done** (that's committed) — it's the `git push` that's hung, and for an HTTPS GitHub remote that almost always means **it's silently waiting for authentication**.\n\nDo this:\n1. **Ctrl+C** to cancel the stuck push.\n2. Run push alone so you can see the prompt:\n   ```bash\n   git push\n   ```\n3. If it asks for **Username / Password**:\n   - Username = your GitHub username.\n   - **Password = a Personal Access Token**, *not* your account password (GitHub disabled password auth). Create one at github.com → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens, with `repo` scope, and paste it as the password.\n\nIf it hangs again with **no visible prompt**, force one:\n```bash\nGIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=1 git push\n```\n\nQuick diagnostics if it keeps hanging:\n```bash\ngit remote -v                          # confirm it's the https://github.com/... URL\ngit config --get credential.helper     # a broken/stale helper can hang\n```\n- If a credential helper is stuck, you can bypass it once with the `GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=1` line above.\n- **Cleaner long-term:** switch to SSH so you never get auth prompts (if you have SSH keys on the server):\n  ```bash\n  git remote set-url origin git@github.com:adhityablubridge/Context_Parallelism.git\n  git push\n  ```\n\nYour commits are safe locally either way — the push just needs to authenticate. Once it goes through, do `git pull` on your local machine to converge, and you're back to work (rebuild the binary + launch s=16).\n\nTell me what the prompt or error says after Ctrl+C and retry, and I'll get you past it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":770374,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":2199,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":770374,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2199,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":770374,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":770374},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdbibDvQrrxYXd9z7U4gA","type":"assistant","uuid":"62e8d0a4-468e-4fc4-b81d-ef6a5b5fb65d","timestamp":"2026-08-01T08:32:50.478Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
