{"parentUuid":"186bcee5-ce40-4eb4-ac18-869c868618b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbipv5kfeN1DSUReW8iG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1263,"cache_read_input_tokens":795118,"output_tokens":2425,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1263,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2425,"cache_read_input_tokens":795118,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1263,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1263},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbipqNUov6gZ1pHtoyrz","type":"assistant","uuid":"c03c737a-a7e0-4048-b4e9-2f57436bfdff","timestamp":"2026-08-01T08:35:37.526Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"c03c737a-a7e0-4048-b4e9-2f57436bfdff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdbipv5kfeN1DSUReW8iG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Classic headless-server hang: git is trying to pop a **GUI password prompt** (via `GIT_ASKPASS`/`SSH_ASKPASS`) but there's no display, so it waits forever with no output. Fetch worked earlier because the repo is public (no auth needed); push needs auth and gets stuck on the invisible prompt.\n\n**Ctrl+C**, then force git to prompt in the terminal (disable the askpass):\n```bash\nGIT_ASKPASS= SSH_ASKPASS= GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=1 git push\n```\nNow you should get a real `Username:` prompt → `adhityablubridge`, then paste your **Personal Access Token** as the password (it won't echo).\n\nTo confirm that was the cause, you can check:\n```bash\necho \"GIT_ASKPASS=$GIT_ASKPASS  SSH_ASKPASS=$SSH_ASKPASS  DISPLAY=$DISPLAY\"\n```\nIf `GIT_ASKPASS`/`SSH_ASKPASS` is set (and `DISPLAY` empty), that was it.\n\n**Save it so this never recurs:**\n```bash\ngit config credential.helper store\nGIT_ASKPASS= SSH_ASKPASS= GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=1 git push   # enter once, cached in ~/.git-credentials\n```\n\n**Or skip HTTPS auth entirely with SSH** (most reliable on a server) — if the server has a key on your GitHub account:\n```bash\ngit remote set-url origin git@github.com:adhityablubridge/Context_Parallelism.git\ngit push\n```\n\nTry the `GIT_ASKPASS= SSH_ASKPASS= GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=1 git push` line — that almost always breaks this exact silent hang. Tell me what prompt appears."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1263,"cache_read_input_tokens":795118,"output_tokens":2425,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1263,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2425,"cache_read_input_tokens":795118,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1263,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1263},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbipqNUov6gZ1pHtoyrz","type":"assistant","uuid":"e2457b6c-f52c-490d-b36b-9176503e8788","timestamp":"2026-08-01T08:35:44.799Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
