the file** — your work is safe on both machines.\\n- The old `merge=keep-local` lines in `.gitattributes` are now dead (notebooks aren't tracked), but harmless — you can leave them or delete those two lines later.\\n- If you ever *do* want to share a notebook deliberately, `git add -f graph_bluscript_cp.ipynb` overrides the ignore for that one commit.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":58},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4af9bc54-aed5-4383-af6d-09444589df81","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:28:38.801Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
