{"parentUuid":"8b4a4f97-b0d3-4db3-8913-cfb665f654fa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdboDk8KdJ1tGhfa9xfHw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Not yet** — remember the earlier run failed because the server binary was **stale** (no resident evaluator → it fell into training mode). You must **rebuild first**. On the server:\n\n**1. Get the latest code and confirm the LongRoPE source is actually there:**\n```bash\ncd /mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism\ngit pull\ngrep -c CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH Scripts/Blutrain/bluscriptCP.cpp    # must print a number > 0\nls context_parallel/LongRoPEOps.h                              # must exist\n```\nIf `grep` prints `0` or the header is missing, the LongRoPE source never got pushed — tell me and we'll commit+push it from local first.\n\n**2. Rebuild:**\n```bash\nmake CP_FUSED_ROPE=1 bluscript-cp cp-rope-longrope\n```\n\n**3. Verify the new binary has the resident evaluator** (must print `[longrope-search] resident evaluator ready` then `PPL <v>` — **not** \"Starting training...\"):\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nprintf 'n_hat 0\\ns 16\\nS_search 65536\\nlambda %s\\n' \"$(python3 -c \"print(' '.join(['1.00']*32))\")\" > /tmp/c.txt\nprintf '/tmp/c.txt\\n' | env $ARCH CP_LONGROPE_SEARCH=1 CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=1 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec 2>&1 | tail -30\n```\n\n**4. Only if that prints a `PPL` → launch the s=16 run on GPU 5:**\n```bash\nBASE_RUN=30 BASE_MAX_STEPS=917 GPU=5 S=16 COMPOSE=alone \\\n  DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n  nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > lr_s16_alone.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f lr_s16_alone.log\n```\n\nSo: **pull → verify source → rebuild → verify binary prints PPL → then launch.** The rebuild is the step that was missing. Paste the output of step 3 if it still says \"Starting training...\" or errors."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2114,"cache_read_input_tokens":835960,"output_tokens":3777,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2114,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3777,"cache_read_input_tokens":835960,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2114,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2114},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdboDg8UBLmd7ti4WiiNb","type":"assistant","uuid":"2dd13e1f-5483-4fe8-8513-47fc99abc923","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:33:39.552Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
