{"parentUuid":"55e37fd1-a04f-40cd-8c16-5d86fff5e4b5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdboqgEB3nCeyrckPs99Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3786,"cache_read_input_tokens":838074,"output_tokens":1365,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3786,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":838074,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3786},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdboqcNVskdWXenmwhqHe","type":"assistant","uuid":"b9e77100-895a-495e-b202-198ab64cefd4","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:41:05.509Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"b9e77100-895a-495e-b202-198ab64cefd4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdboqgEB3nCeyrckPs99Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's the confirmation — **`PPL 305.48578`** means the rebuilt binary's resident evaluator is live, and **64k fits on GPU 5**. (305 is high because that was the `λ=1` identity candidate = plain RoPE extrapolation at 64k on a 4k-trained model — exactly the aliasing the search will fix. The PI/NTK/YaRN seeds start far lower, and evolution drives it down.)\n\n**Launch the s=16 run:**\n```bash\nBASE_RUN=30 BASE_MAX_STEPS=917 GPU=5 S=16 COMPOSE=alone \\\n  DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n  nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > lr_s16_alone.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f lr_s16_alone.log\n```\n\nWhat you'll see in the log, in order:\n1. `[gen 0] seeds -> best PPL …` with PI/NTK/YaRN baselines (these should be **well below 305**).\n2. `[gen N] best PPL … no_improve=K elapsed=…h` per generation — watch **best PPL trending down** and the **`no_improve`** counter; when it hits `PATIENCE=4`, the search **early-stops**.\n3. `BEST PPL … -> longrope_best.txt`.\n4. Then the **LongRoPE-alone fine-tune** at 64k (run 80+), then the **eval** → `ppl_longrope_x16_alone.csv`.\n\nRough timing: ~2–5h search + ~2.5–5h fine-tune @64k + ~10 min eval. The search early-stops when converged, so it's often faster.\n\nSanity checks as it runs:\n- `nvidia-smi -i 5` — GPU 5 should be busy.\n- If gen-0 seed PPLs are *not* below ~305, or it errors, paste the log tail.\n- The fine-tuned checkpoint lands at **run 80** (auto-increments if taken), never overwriting run 30.\n\nYou're finally off — after it finishes, overlay `ppl_longrope_x16_alone.csv` against your YaRN/CREAM curves in the notebook. Ping me with the gen-0 seed PPLs once they print and I'll sanity-check them."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3786,"cache_read_input_tokens":838074,"output_tokens":1365,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3786,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":838074,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3786,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3786},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdboqcNVskdWXenmwhqHe","type":"assistant","uuid":"fa823c29-00e6-47f7-8f70-f349d9f82086","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:41:15.433Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
