\\n- If gen-0 seed PPLs are *not* below ~305, or it errors, paste the log tail.\\n- The fine-tuned checkpoint lands at **run 80** (auto-increments if taken), never overwriting run 30.\\n\\nYou're finally off — after it finishes, overlay `ppl_longrope_x16_alone.csv` against your YaRN/CREAM curves in the notebook. Ping me with the gen-0 seed PPLs once they print and I'll sanity-check them.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":45},"type":"attachment","uuid":"33082e1c-251a-46fc-855e-a22d97651728","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:41:15.527Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
