{"parentUuid":"b0f26486-c868-40f5-b934-ee59f3eefd54","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdbpGnKEioE9R2gw9FQR5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rough total: **~3–7 hours, best guess ~4–5h** on the single 6000 Ada. Breakdown:\n\n| Stage | Estimate | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Search** | ~1.5–4h | Early-stops when converged (`PATIENCE=4`); hard cap 8.5h |\n| **Fine-tune** @64k (LongRoPE-alone) | ~1.5–3h | 300 steps of real 64k training — the heavy part |\n| **Eval** @64k (32 windows) | ~10 min | |\n\nThe **search** dominates the uncertainty. Its cost = `evals × per-eval`:\n- Evals: initial 16 + ~16/generation. With early-stop it usually converges in ~5–10 gens → **~110–170 evals** (fewer with memoization). Worst case (no early stop, 20 iters) ~336.\n- Per-eval @64k on the 6000 Ada: I estimate ~40–60s (each = 3 windows × a 64k forward + NLL).\n\n**You can get the exact number from the log itself:**\n- Time between two consecutive `PPL` / candidate-build lines = one eval. Multiply by evals/gen.\n- Once the `[gen N] … elapsed=X.XXh` lines appear, that field is the running search clock — extrapolate to the remaining generations.\n\nSo: watch the first `[gen 0] seeds -> best PPL` line (gen 0 = the 16 initial evals; the time to reach it ÷ 16 = your per-eval), and the `no_improve` counter — when it hits 4, the search ends and it moves to the fine-tune.\n\nIf you paste the timestamps of the first couple of `[gen …]` lines (they include `elapsed=`), I'll give you a precise total-time estimate instead of the range. And remember: it's `nohup`'d, so it runs even if you disconnect — reattach with `tail -f lr_s16_alone.log`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1678,"cache_read_input_tokens":843997,"output_tokens":1915,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1678,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1915,"cache_read_input_tokens":843997,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1678},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdbpGhq7NGJ6bBzbmponU","type":"assistant","uuid":"17e07761-6269-4731-8ef5-d16bd6c90919","timestamp":"2026-08-01T09:47:04.145Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
