{"parentUuid":"834c836b-6fa8-463d-98a3-d00d2a7a3b61","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdc39qtN8MFeupo6eAYb4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That one **worked** — no OOM (forward-only fits at 64k), and it wrote `ppl_longrope_x16_searchonly.csv` (65536 positions, 32 windows). So you now have a legitimate **s=16 LongRoPE curve without fine-tuning** — the base model at 64k with the searched cache.\n\nTwo things:\n\n**1. You can plot this now** (in the notebook, add `ppl_longrope_x16_searchonly.csv`). Given the search averaged ~267 PPL, expect it **flat but high** — that's the honest \"64× extension, no fine-tune, 48M model\" result. Overlay it against a plain-YaRN-at-64k curve (`CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS` unset, `YARN_SCALE=16`) to see if the search beat YaRN.\n\n**2. For a stronger, fine-tuned result → run s=8 (32k)** — the fine-tune fits there and the extension is reasonable:\n```bash\nBASE_RUN=30 BASE_MAX_STEPS=917 GPU=5 S=8 COMPOSE=alone \\\n  DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n  nohup bash Tests/bluscriptcp/run_longrope_pipeline.sh > lr_s8_alone.log 2>&1 &\ntail -f lr_s8_alone.log\n```\nThis runs the full chain (search → 32k fine-tune → eval) end to end. Watch for the fine-tune stage — 32k fwd+bwd should fit the 48 GB (~13 GB logits), unlike 64k.\n\nQuick recap of where you are:\n- ✅ Everything builds & runs on the server; resident evaluator + search + eval all working.\n- ✅ `s=16` **search-only** result in hand (`ppl_longrope_x16_searchonly.csv`).\n- ⚠️ `s=16` **fine-tune** needs CP=2 (doesn't fit one GPU) — deferred unless you want it.\n- ▶️ **Next:** `s=8` full pipeline for a fine-tuned result that fits.\n\nNothing's blocked anymore — kick off `s=8`, and while it runs you can plot the s=16 search-only curve. Ping me with the `s=8` gen-0 seed PPLs and I'll sanity-check whether the search is finding real gains at 32× (it should do better than it did at 64×)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8569,"cache_read_input_tokens":856012,"output_tokens":1499,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8569,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1499,"cache_read_input_tokens":856012,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8569},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdc39nN2yEwuWTFs1g7Pz","type":"assistant","uuid":"87ce7d5e-f300-4108-9351-089633d1848d","timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:35:55.390Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
