{"parentUuid":"e725c6f9-3320-4463-940a-3336eabd02e6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_1901960","hookName":"Stop","hookEvent":"Stop","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"[SessionEnd] Updated session file: /home/blu-bridge25/.claude/sessions/2026-08-01-CP-session.tmp\n","exitCode":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7a2221dc-fd6a-49b3-9165-5d855b3d88d2","timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:43:57.220Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"7a2221dc-fd6a-49b3-9165-5d855b3d88d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdc3oH5DfnMbCmH6xdMeQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2374,"cache_read_input_tokens":864581,"output_tokens":3462,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2374,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3462,"cache_read_input_tokens":864581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2374,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2374},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdc3o9S5u7AxUhm8A9VVb","type":"assistant","uuid":"50f83447-eff3-4037-9078-7d96fe05f609","timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:44:30.385Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"50f83447-eff3-4037-9078-7d96fe05f609","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdc3oH5DfnMbCmH6xdMeQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No — **this IS the LongRoPE curve** (the legend says \"LongRoPEx16\"). It's the base model (run 30) **with the searched LongRoPE cache applied, but no fine-tuning** — the \"search-only\" result.\n\n## What it's telling you\n- **Flat ~200 PPL from 0 to ~20k** — the searched cache holds the model steady out to ~20k (that's **~5× the original 4k context** with zero fine-tuning). That's LongRoPE working.\n- **Rises past ~20k → ~600 by 64k** — beyond ~5×, the un-fine-tuned model degrades. The cache alone can't carry it to 64× without training.\n\nSo LongRoPE-search-only bought you a clean ~5× extension, then falls apart — which is expected for 64× on a 48M model with no fine-tune.\n\n## To actually answer \"is this better than base?\" — plot the real baselines\nRight now you have no reference, so you can't tell if LongRoPE helped. Generate the two baselines at 64k (same eval, no LongRoPE) and overlay:\n\n**Plain RoPE (no YaRN, no LongRoPE)** — should blow up right after 4k:\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=1 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_base_noyarn_64k.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n\n**YaRN (no LongRoPE)** — the fixed-formula competitor:\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=65536 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=16 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_base_yarn_64k.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n(no `CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS` = no LongRoPE in both.)\n\nOverlay all three: **plain RoPE** (breaks at ~4k), **YaRN** (flatter), **LongRoPE-search-only** (flat to ~20k). If LongRoPE's flat region extends further than YaRN's, the search paid off — even without fine-tuning.\n\nThen the fine-tuned story is the `s=8` run you're (hopefully) launching — that should push the flat region out much further at 32×, where the model has the capacity to actually learn it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2374,"cache_read_input_tokens":864581,"output_tokens":3462,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2374,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3462,"cache_read_input_tokens":864581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2374,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2374},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdc3o9S5u7AxUhm8A9VVb","type":"assistant","uuid":"a01eb8ba-82d7-4990-85ce-95cf82bb1280","timestamp":"2026-08-01T12:44:45.552Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
