{"parentUuid":"94f926d8-87a5-4395-8c69-019fc029db7f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdcDTo57PS7j5rwxGoJ1w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":850034,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":2466,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":850034,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2466,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":850034,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":850034},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdcDTYtLT1TaXFSyN8RF7","type":"assistant","uuid":"3cf543b1-6b80-4ea2-b675-f0ba2aa16847","timestamp":"2026-08-01T14:51:19.359Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"3cf543b1-6b80-4ea2-b675-f0ba2aa16847","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdcDTo57PS7j5rwxGoJ1w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"From the pace in your log, here's the timing:\n\n**Search: ~15 more minutes.** It's converging flat again — best PPL stuck at **202.63** with `no_improve` climbing (2→3). At `no_improve=4` it early-stops (`PATIENCE=4`), so it'll stop at **gen 4**. Pace is ~0.23h/gen (gen 2 = 0.70h, gen 3 = 0.93h), so gen 4 lands ~**1.15h total** → about **10–15 min left** in the search.\n\n**Then the pipeline continues:**\n| Stage | ~time |\n|---|---|\n| Fine-tune @32k (LongRoPE-alone) | ~1.5–2.5h |\n| Eval @32k (32 windows) | ~5 min |\n\n**Total remaining: ~2–3 hours** (search ~15 min + fine-tune ~2h + eval).\n\nTwo things to note:\n\n1. **The search is flat at the NTK seed again** (202.63, same pattern as s=16's 267). So the GA isn't beating NTK for this model — a real finding: for a 48M model, the *searched* interpolation doesn't improve on the NTK formula. (Good news: **202 at 32× beats 267 at 64×**, confirming smaller extension = better, as expected.) If you want the search to actually explore more, you'd raise `CALIB` (less noisy fitness) and `PATIENCE` — but honestly, the flatness suggests the model is capacity-limited, not interpolation-limited.\n\n2. **Watch the fine-tune stage for OOM.** 32k is lighter than the 64k that crashed (~13 GB logits vs 26 GB), so it *should* fit the 48 GB — but keep an eye on `tail lr_s8_alone.log` when it hits \"Starting training...\". If it OOMs there too, the fine-tune needs CP=2 (or drop to `s=4`/16k, which definitely fits).\n\nSo: ~15 min more search, then ~2h fine-tune, then a quick eval — you'll have the fine-tuned `s=8` curve in ~2–3h. It's `nohup`'d, so it runs whether or not you're watching."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":850034,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":2466,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":850034,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2466,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":850034,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":850034},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdcDTYtLT1TaXFSyN8RF7","type":"assistant","uuid":"b09e02e7-0a99-4b3c-a8a0-043eb9566d54","timestamp":"2026-08-01T14:51:28.159Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
