{"parentUuid":"583ea1ef-8e43-49a6-a518-fdc3dadd0984","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdcE1rNSYaFVyDvymbYbW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_read_input_tokens":874454,"output_tokens":3171,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3171,"cache_read_input_tokens":874454,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdcE1kAP87WvyqnRGym61","type":"assistant","uuid":"990c32ca-b84d-402e-83d7-a92e8e454453","timestamp":"2026-08-01T14:58:29.871Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"990c32ca-b84d-402e-83d7-a92e8e454453","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdcE1rNSYaFVyDvymbYbW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The **search alone doesn't produce a position-graph** — it only writes `longrope_best.txt` (the λ/n̂ vector) plus the scalar per-generation PPLs in the log (which are flat at 202.63, so a convergence plot wouldn't be interesting).\n\nBut you **can** get a PPL-vs-position graph from the searched cache **without waiting for the ~2h fine-tune** — that's exactly the \"search-only eval\" you already did for x16. Once `longrope_best.txt` is written (in ~10 min), run:\n\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_longrope_x8_searchonly.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=<a FREE gpu> \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n→ writes `ppl_longrope_x8_searchonly.csv` in ~5 min → plot it in the notebook (add to `CURVES`). This is 32k, so it fits easily.\n\nTwo notes:\n- **Use a GPU other than 5** — GPU 5 is busy with the pipeline's fine-tune. Pick a free one (`nvidia-smi` to check). Both reads of `longrope_best.txt` are of the same static file, so no conflict.\n- This gives you the **search-only x8 curve** (base + searched cache, no fine-tune) — directly comparable to your x16 search-only plot. The pipeline's later `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv` is the **fine-tuned** version (better, but ~2h out).\n\nSo: search → factors file (no graph); one quick eval → the graph. You don't have to wait for the fine-tune to see a curve."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_read_input_tokens":874454,"output_tokens":3171,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3171,"cache_read_input_tokens":874454,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdcE1kAP87WvyqnRGym61","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b1459c7-7a64-40ea-a36a-9834aca4d09a","timestamp":"2026-08-01T14:58:38.784Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
