{"parentUuid":"1128319e-0063-4bb6-b431-26d717868712","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdfDsvJ86EQqpttFtmyzP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The **s=8 search finished** (converged, best PPL 202.63 → `longrope_best.txt`, 1.15h). The pipeline then errored — but **not on memory**, on a stale run-number guard:\n```\nERROR: run 200 already exists -- set FT_RUN to a free number\n```\nRun 200 is leftover from the s=16 fine-tune that OOM'd earlier. The server's `run_longrope_pipeline.sh` is an **older version** — it predates the `FT_RUN=80` auto-increment fix I made, so it errors instead of picking the next free number. And GPU 5 is now free (the pipeline exited).\n\n## Quick graph now (what you wanted — ~5 min, no fine-tune)\nThe search is done, so eval the base with the searched cache directly:\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_longrope_x8_searchonly.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n→ `ppl_longrope_x8_searchonly.csv` → plot in the notebook (overlay with your x16 curve). This is 32k, fits easily, no OOM.\n\n## To get the fine-tuned x8 result\nThe pipeline needs the run-number fix. On the server:\n```bash\ngit pull                         # gets the FT_RUN=80 auto-increment version of the pipeline\nrm -rf checkpoints_bluscriptcp/blumodelcp_run200_*   # clean the leftover OOM'd run (optional)\n```\nThen re-launch — **but** it would redo the ~1h search. To skip that, just run the fine-tune manually with a free run number using the `longrope_best.txt` you already have:\n```bash\n(cd checkpoints_bluscriptcp && for f in blumodelcp_run30_*; do cp \"$f\" \"${f/run30/run81}\"; done)\nenv $ARCH CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_GLOBAL_BATCH=131072 CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt \\\n    CP_CKPT=1 CP_CKPT_RESUME=81 CP_MAX_STEPS=1217 CP_REWARMUP=100 CP_REWARMUP_PEAK=0.3 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\nWatch for OOM after `Starting training...` (32k should fit, unlike 64k). If it trains, eval run 81 the same way (`CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv`).\n\n**Do the quick search-only eval first** — that gives you the x8 graph in 5 minutes to compare against x16, while you decide whether to spend ~2h on the fine-tune."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":858995,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":6911,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":858995,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6911,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":858995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":858995},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdfDsngj1qe7V6HjKKb82","type":"assistant","uuid":"04170523-8e57-4765-b8cb-11a5f8dc4e9f","timestamp":"2026-08-03T04:59:31.813Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
