{"parentUuid":"f1869ade-dacd-4210-8c89-f4fc52e642f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdfXBZSUqqqamQXW4Zio5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 32k fine-tune **fit and finished** (no OOM — confirming 32k is within the 48 GB budget, unlike 64k). Now eval the fine-tuned checkpoint (run 81) to get the final curve:\n\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 \\\n    CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS=longrope_best.txt CP_CKPT_RESUME=81 \\\n    CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n→ writes `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv` (~5 min) — this is the **fine-tuned** LongRoPE x8 (32k) curve.\n\nThen plot in the notebook, overlaying the meaningful comparison at 32k:\n- `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv` — **LongRoPE + fine-tune** (this run)\n- `ppl_longrope_x8_searchonly.csv` — **LongRoPE, no fine-tune** (if you ran it)\n- a **YaRN-only @32k** baseline (`CP_T=32768 YARN_SCALE=8 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096`, no `CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS`, `CP_CKPT_RESUME=30`)\n\nWhat you want to see: the **fine-tuned** curve flat and low much further out than the search-only one, and ideally at/below YaRN — that's the payoff of the fine-tune. Given the search was flat at the NTK seed, the main gain here should come from the **fine-tuning**, not the search per se.\n\nRun the eval and paste the `PPL<4096 / PPL≥4096 / ratio` verdict (or the plot) — I'll tell you whether the 32k extension held up."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":865911,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"output_tokens":1316,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":865911,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1316,"cache_read_input_tokens":21078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":865911,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":865911},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdfXBKoC5eL8Abw9qJvtz","type":"assistant","uuid":"a018a10c-ecc9-4fa8-b07b-6b1d02bc4465","timestamp":"2026-08-03T08:45:18.933Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
