{"parentUuid":"f007c768-d21f-4d85-8ea6-4c3c0e2541e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdfxN7LZgU25cqABM8EZZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":897014,"output_tokens":2001,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2001,"cache_read_input_tokens":897014,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdfxMwL48D5cgCSj2WzyP","type":"assistant","uuid":"8117808a-b338-49ca-8a73-95527e4aa79a","timestamp":"2026-08-03T14:15:22.033Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
{"parentUuid":"8117808a-b338-49ca-8a73-95527e4aa79a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdfxN7LZgU25cqABM8EZZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — exactly. **\"Naive\" = the base model (run 30, trained at 4k) evaluated at 32k with YaRN turned on *only at inference*, no fine-tuning.**\n\nConcretely that's:\n```bash\nCP_CKPT_RESUME=30            # base weights, unchanged\nCP_T=32768                   # eval at 32k\nYARN_SCALE=8 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096   # YaRN cache at inference\n# NO CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS, NO fine-tune\n```\nThe YaRN-scaled cos/sin cache is used, but the **weights are the un-adapted 4k base**. So it measures \"what does YaRN-at-inference alone buy you, with zero training.\" That's the reference the fine-tuned methods (LongRoPE run 81, CREAM, etc.) should beat.\n\nOne distinction to keep straight — there are **two** naive variants, and they answer different questions:\n\n| Naive variant | Setting | Shape | Question it answers |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Naive + YaRN** (what you mean) | `YARN_SCALE=8` | flat but **elevated** | Does YaRN need fine-tuning? |\n| **Naive, no YaRN** | `YARN_SCALE=1` | **blows up** past 4k | Is any extension method needed at all? |\n\nSo your \"naive run\" = the first row: base + YaRN@eval, no fine-tune, flat-but-high.\n\nTo regenerate it cleanly (in case the file got overwritten), that exact command:\n```bash\nARCH=\"CP_SIZE=1 CP_N_EMBD=384 CP_N_LAYER=6 CP_N_HEAD=6 CP_N_KVHEAD=2 CP_FFN=1024 CP_WEIGHT_TYING=0\"\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=8 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_naive_yarn_x8_32k.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n\nSo your 32k comparison set is: **naive+YaRN** (this), **LongRoPE-alone fine-tuned** (run 81 → `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv`), and optionally **LongRoPE search-only** (base + cache, no fine-tune) — overlay all three and the fine-tuned curve should sit lowest/flattest."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":897014,"output_tokens":2001,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2001,"cache_read_input_tokens":897014,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011CdfxMwL48D5cgCSj2WzyP","type":"assistant","uuid":"90938e3f-b719-4882-a742-a6f0e0c5d835","timestamp":"2026-08-03T14:15:33.168Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
