=0\\\"\\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=8 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 \\\\\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=30 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_naive_yarn_x8_32k.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=5 \\\\\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/volgrp03/3rd_floor/Adhitya/CP/Context_Parallelism/Data_Loader/Data \\\\\\n    LD_LIBRARY_PATH=BluTrain/Tensor-Implementations/lib:BluTrain/Profiler/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH \\\\\\n    mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\\n```\\n\\nSo your 32k comparison set is: **naive+YaRN** (this), **LongRoPE-alone fine-tuned** (run 81 → `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv`), and optionally **LongRoPE search-only** (base + cache, no fine-tune) — overlay all three and the fine-tuned curve should sit lowest/flattest.\",\"background_tasks\":[],\"session_crons\":[]}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/hooks/run-with-flags.js\" \"stop:check-console-log\" \"scripts/hooks/check-console-log.js\" \"standard,strict\"","durationMs":58},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1c87e075-6f15-413b-a3ac-b3959254997f","timestamp":"2026-08-03T14:15:33.299Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
