{"parentUuid":"82951d81-c0b8-43bb-84bc-7d4a60eb1df3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Cdfy7p5xhYg5xzZ3BRYxj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One bug: **run-number mismatch.** You fine-tune into **run 300** but the eval resumes **run 82** — so the eval would load the wrong (or nonexistent) checkpoint. Fix the eval to `CP_CKPT_RESUME=300`:\n\n```bash\nenv $ARCH CP_EVAL_PPL=1 CP_T=32768 CP_B=1 CP_EVAL_WINDOWS=32 YARN_SCALE=8 YARN_ORIG_MAXPOS=4096 \\\n    CP_CKPT_RESUME=300 CP_EVAL_OUT=ppl_yarn_lce_x8_32k.csv CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4 \\\n    CP_DATA_ROOT=$DR LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD mpirun -np 1 ./build/bluscriptCP_exec\n```\n\nEverything else is correct:\n- Branch `run30 → run300`, fine-tune `917→1217` at 32k, `YARN_SCALE=8`, **no `CP_LONGROPE_FACTORS`** → proper YaRN-LCE. ✓\n- GPU 5 for fine-tune, GPU 4 for eval — fine (they run sequentially anyway; just make sure GPU 4 is free when the eval starts).\n\nTwo quick checks before you run:\n1. **Confirm run 300 is free** so the `cp` doesn't clobber anything:\n   ```bash\n   ls checkpoints_bluscriptcp/blumodelcp_run300_* 2>/dev/null && echo \"run 300 EXISTS - pick another\" || echo \"run 300 free\"\n   ```\n2. The eval only runs after the fine-tune finishes (no `&`), so it's sequential — good.\n\nWith `CP_CKPT_RESUME=300` in the eval, you're set: it produces `ppl_yarn_lce_x8_32k.csv`, your fine-tuned YaRN baseline to overlay against `ppl_longrope_x8_alone.csv` (run 81)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1916,"cache_read_input_tokens":903421,"output_tokens":1775,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1916,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1775,"cache_read_input_tokens":903421,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1916,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1916},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdfy7hkxZtzYBZdW68GFy","type":"assistant","uuid":"12475bcf-cc2a-45c0-bd9a-4f3c17a0785e","timestamp":"2026-08-03T14:25:25.495Z","effort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/blu-bridge25/CP","sessionId":"3d913bc2-47ed-4031-b9d2-02eae46f0296","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"polished-cuddling-graham"}
